API","User-Agent","Accept"],"ko":["OAuth 통합","GitHub OAuth","Microsoft OAuth","Cloudflare Workers","OAuth 인증","fetch API","User-Agent","Accept"],"es":["integraciones de OAuth","entornos de edge","Cloudflare Workers","GitHub OAuth","Microsoft OAuth","autenticación y autorización","API de GitHub","biblioteca Fetch"],"fr":["intégrations OAuth","environnements de edge","Cloudflare Workers","GitHub OAuth","Microsoft OAuth","authentification et autorisation","API GitHub","bibliothèque Fetch"],"de":["OAuth-Integrationen","Edge-Umgebungen","Cloudflare Workers","GitHub OAuth","Microsoft OAuth","Authentifizierung und Autorisierung","GitHub-API","Fetch-Bibliothek"],"pt":["oauth-integrations","autenticação OAuth","GitHub OAuth","Microsoft OAuth","Cloudflare Workers","ambientes de borda","integração de autenticação","requisitos de cabeçalho","User-Agent","Accept"],"ru":["oauth-integrations","аутентификация OAuth","GitHub OAuth","Microsoft OAuth","Cloudflare Workers","краевые среды","интеграция аутентификации","требования к заголовкам","User-Agent","Accept"],"ar":["oauth-integrations","المصادقة OAuth","GitHub OAuth","Microsoft OAuth","Cloudflare Workers","بيئات الحافة","تكامل المصادقة","متطلبات الرأس","User-Agent","Accept"]}},"owner":"dennislee928","repo":"Smart_Zone","repoPath":"dennislee928/Smart_Zone","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.351Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"oauth-integrations","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# OAuth Integrations for Edge Environments\n\nImplement GitHub and Microsoft OAuth in Cloudflare Workers and other edge runtimes.\n\n## GitHub OAuth\n\n### Required Headers\n\nGitHub API has strict requirements that differ from other providers.\n\n| Header | Requirement |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `User-Agent` | **REQUIRED** - Returns 403 without it |\n| `Accept` | `application/vnd.github+json` recommended |\n\n```typescript\nconst resp = await fetch(''https://api.github.com/user'', {\n  headers: {\n    Authoriz","body":"# OAuth Integrations for Edge Environments\n\nImplement GitHub and Microsoft OAuth in Cloudflare Workers and other edge runtimes.\n\n## GitHub OAuth\n\n### Required Headers\n\nGitHub API has strict requirements that differ from other providers.\n\n| Header | Requirement |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `User-Agent` | **REQUIRED** - Returns 403 without it |\n| `Accept` | `application/vnd.github+json` recommended |\n\n```typescript\nconst resp = await fetch(''https://api.github.com/user'', {\n  headers: {\n    Authorization: `Bearer ${accessToken}`,\n    ''User-Agent'': ''MyApp/1.0'',  // Required!\n    ''Accept'': ''application/vnd.github+json'',\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Private Email Handling\n\nGitHub users can set email to private (`/user` returns `email: null`).\n\n```typescript\nif (!userData.email) {\n  const emails = await fetch(''https://api.github.com/user/emails'', { headers })\n    .then(r => r.json());\n  userData.email = emails.find(e => e.primary && e.verified)?.email;\n}\n```\n\nRequires `user:email` scope.\n\n### Token Exchange\n\nToken exchange returns form-encoded by default. Add Accept header for JSON:\n\n```typescript\nconst tokenResponse = await fetch(''https://github.com/login/oauth/access_token'', {\n  method: ''POST'',\n  headers: {\n    ''Content-Type'': ''application/x-www-form-urlencoded'',\n    ''Accept'': ''application/json'',  // Get JSON response\n  },\n  body: new URLSearchParams({ code, client_id, client_secret, redirect_uri }),\n});\n```\n\n### GitHub OAuth Notes\n\n| Issue | Solution |\n|-------|----------|\n| Callback URL | Must be EXACT - no wildcards, no subdirectory matching |\n| Token exchange returns form-encoded | Add `''Accept'': ''application/json''` header |\n| Tokens don''t expire | No refresh flow needed, but revoked = full re-auth |\n\n## Microsoft Entra (Azure AD) OAuth\n\n### Why MSAL Doesn''t Work in Workers\n\nMSAL.js depends on:\n- Browser APIs (localStorage, sessionStorage, DOM)\n- Node.js crypto module\n\nCloudflare''s V8 isolate runtime has neither. Use manual OAuth instead:\n1. Manual OAuth URL construction\n2. Direct token exchange via fetch\n3. JWT validation with `jose` library\n\n### Required Scopes\n\n```typescript\n// For user identity (email, name, profile picture)\nconst scope = ''openid email profile User.Read'';\n\n// For refresh tokens (long-lived sessions)\nconst scope = ''openid email profile User.Read offline_access'';\n```\n\n**Critical**: `User.Read` is required for Microsoft Graph `/me` endpoint. Without it, token exchange succeeds but user info fetch returns 403.\n\n### User Info Endpoint\n\n```typescript\n// Microsoft Graph /me endpoint\nconst resp = await fetch(''https://graph.microsoft.com/v1.0/me'', {\n  headers: { Authorization: `Bearer ${accessToken}` },\n});\n\n// Email may be in different fields\nconst email = data.mail || data.userPrincipalName;\n```\n\n### Tenant Configuration\n\n| Tenant Value | Who Can Sign In |\n|--------------|-----------------|\n| `common` | Any Microsoft account (personal + work) |\n| `organizations` | Work/school accounts only |\n| `consumers` | Personal Microsoft accounts only |\n| `{tenant-id}` | Specific organization only |\n\n### Azure Portal Setup\n\n1. App Registration → New registration\n2. Platform: **Web** (not SPA) for server-side OAuth\n3. Redirect URIs: Add both `/callback` and `/admin/callback`\n4. Certificates & secrets → New client secret\n\n### Token Lifetimes\n\n| Token Type | Default Lifetime | Notes |\n|------------|------------------|-------|\n| Access token | 60-90 minutes | Configurable via token lifetime policies |\n| Refresh token | 90 days | Revoked on password change |\n| ID token | 60 minutes | Same as access token |\n\n**Best Practice**: Always request `offline_access` scope and implement refresh token flow for sessions longer than 1 hour.\n\n## Common Corrections\n\n| If Claude suggests... | Use instead... |\n|----------------------|----------------|\n| GitHub fetch without User-Agent | Add `''User-Agent'': ''AppName/1.0''` (REQUIRED) |\n| Using MSAL.js in Workers | Manual OAuth + jose for JWT validation |\n| Microsoft scope without User.Read | Add `User.Read` scope |\n| Fetching email from token claims only | Use Graph `/me` endpoint |\n\n## Error Reference\n\n### GitHub Errors\n\n| Error | Cause | Fix |\n|-------|-------|-----|\n| 403 Forbidden | Missing User-Agent header | Add User-Agent header |\n| `email: null` | User has private email | Fetch `/user/emails` with `user:email` scope |\n\n### Microsoft Errors\n\n| Error | Cause | Fix |\n|-------|-------|-----|\n| AADSTS50058 | Silent auth failed | Use interactive flow |\n| AADSTS700084 | Refresh token expired | Re-authenticate user |\n| 403 on Graph /me | Missing User.Read scope | Add User.Read to scopes |\n\n## Reference\n\n- GitHub API: https://docs.github.com/en/rest\n- GitHub OAuth: https://docs.github.com/en/apps/oauth-apps\n- Microsoft Graph permissions: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/permissions-reference\n- AADSTS error codes: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/identity-platform/reference-error-codes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:49.371Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Edge Environment Agents requiring secure GitHub and Microsoft OAuth integrations","zh":"适用于需要安全的 GitHub 和 Microsoft OAuth 集成的 Edge 环境代理","ja":"GitHub および Microsoft OAuth のセキュアな統合を必要とするエッジ環境エージェントに適しています","ko":"안전한 GitHub 및 Microsoft OAuth 통합을 필요로 하는 에지 환경 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Entorno de Borde que requieren integraciones de GitHub y Microsoft OAuth seguras","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Environnement de Bord nécessitant des intégrations GitHub et Microsoft OAuth sécurisées","de":"Ideal für Edge-Umgebung-Agents, die sichere GitHub- und Microsoft-OAuth-Integrationen erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes em Ambiente Edge que requerem integrações seguras com GitHub e Microsoft OAuth","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов в периферийных средах, требующих безопасной интеграции с GitHub и Microsoft OAuth","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء بيئة Edge التي تتطلب تكاملات آمنة مع GitHub و Microsoft OAuth"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement secure authentication protocols using required headers like `User-Agent` and `Accept`, enabling seamless integration with GitHub and Microsoft APIs in edge environments such as Cloudflare Workers","zh":"赋予代理实现安全的身份验证协议的能力，使用必要的头部如 `User-Agent` 和 `Accept`，从而实现与 GitHub 和 Microsoft APIs 在 Cloudflare Workers 等边缘环境中的无缝集成","ja":"エージェントが `User-Agent` や `Accept` などの必要なヘッダーを使用してセキュアな認証プロトコルを実装する能力を提供し、Cloudflare Workers などのエッジ環境で GitHub および Microsoft APIs とのシームレスな統合を可能にします","ko":"에이전트가 `User-Agent` 및 `Accept` 와 같은 필수적인 헤더를 사용하여 보안 인증 프로토콜을 구현할 수 있는 능력을 제공하여 Cloudflare Workers와 같은 에지 환경에서 GitHub 및 Microsoft APIs와의 無縫한 통합을 가능하게 합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar protocolos de autenticación seguros utilizando encabezados requeridos como `User-Agent` y `Accept`, lo que permite una integración fluida con las API de GitHub y Microsoft en entornos de borde como Cloudflare Workers","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des protocoles d''authentification sécurisés en utilisant des en-têtes requis comme `User-Agent` et `Accept`, permettant ainsi une intégration fluide avec les API GitHub et Microsoft dans des environnements de bord tels que Cloudflare Workers","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, sichere Authentifizierungsprotokolle mithilfe erforderlicher Header wie `User-Agent` und `Accept` umzusetzen, wodurch eine nahtlose Integration mit GitHub- und Microsoft-APIs in Edge-Umgebungen wie Cloudflare Workers ermöglicht wird","pt":"Capacita os agentes a implementar protocolos de autenticação segura usando cabeçalhos obrigatórios como `User-Agent` e `Accept`, permitindo uma integração perfeita com as APIs do GitHub e Microsoft em ambientes edge, como o Cloudflare Workers","ru":"Позволяет агентам реализовывать безопасные протоколы аутентификации с использованием обязательных заголовков, таких как `User-Agent` и `Accept`, обеспечивая беспрепятственную интеграцию с API GitHub и Microsoft в периферийных средах, таких как Cloudflare Workers","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من تنفيذ بروتوكولات المصادقة الآمنة باستخدام الرؤوس المطلوبة مثل `User-Agent` و `Accept`، مما يتيح تكاملاً سلساً مع واجهات برمجة تطبيقات GitHub وMicrosoft في بيئات Edge مثل Cloudflare Workers"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing GitHub OAuth in Cloudflare Workers","Authenticating Microsoft APIs in edge runtimes","Securing API requests with required headers"],"zh":["在 Cloudflare Workers 中实现 GitHub OAuth","在边缘运行时中对 Microsoft APIs 进行身份验证","使用必要的头部来保护 API 请求"],"ja":["Cloudflare Workers で GitHub OAuth を実装する","エッジランタイムで Microsoft APIs を認証する","必要なヘッダーを使用して API リクエストを保護する"],"ko":["Cloudflare Workers에서 GitHub OAuth 구현","에지 런타임에서 Microsoft APIs 인증","필요한 헤더를 사용하여 API 요청 보안"],"es":["Implementar GitHub OAuth en Cloudflare Workers","Autenticar API de Microsoft en tiempo de ejecución de borde","Proteger solicitudes de API con encabezados requeridos"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre GitHub OAuth dans Cloudflare Workers","Authentifier les API Microsoft dans les environnements de bord","Sécuriser les demandes d''API avec des en-têtes requis"],"de":["GitHub-OAuth in Cloudflare Workers implementieren","Microsoft-APIs in Edge-Laufzeitumgebungen authentifizieren","API-Anfragen mit erforderlichen Headern sichern"],"pt":["Implementação de OAuth do GitHub no Cloudflare Workers","Autenticação de APIs Microsoft em tempos de execução edge","Proteção de solicitações de API com cabeçalhos obrigatórios"],"ru":["Реализация OAuth GitHub в Cloudflare Workers","Аутентификация API Microsoft в периферийных средах выполнения","Защита запросов API с помощью обязательных заголовков"],"ar":["تنفيذ GitHub OAuth في Cloudflare Workers","مصادقة واجهات برمجة تطبيقات Microsoft في بيئات التشغيل الطرفية","تأمين طلبات API باستخدام الرؤوس المطلوبة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires specific header configurations","Limited to GitHub and Microsoft OAuth providers","Edge environment compatibility required"],"zh":["需要特定的头部配置","仅限于 GitHub 和 Microsoft OAuth 提供商","需要边缘环境兼容性"],"ja":["特定のヘッダー設定が必要","GitHub および Microsoft OAuth 提供者のみに限定","エッジ環境の互換性が必要"],"ko":["특정 헤더 구성이 필요","GitHub 및 Microsoft OAuth 공급자에만 제한","에지 환경 호환성이 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuraciones de encabezados específicas","Limitado a proveedores de OAuth de GitHub y Microsoft","Se requiere compatibilidad con el entorno de borde"],"fr":["Nécessite des configurations d''en-tête spécifiques","Limité aux fournisseurs d''OAuth GitHub et Microsoft","La compatibilité avec l''environnement de bord est requise"],"de":["Erfordert spezifische Header-Konfigurationen","Begrenzt auf GitHub- und Microsoft-OAuth-Anbieter","Edge-Umgebungs-Kompatibilität ist erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer configurações específicas de cabeçalho","Limitado aos provedores de OAuth do GitHub e Microsoft","Requer compatibilidade com ambiente edge"],"ru":["Требует определенной конфигурации заголовков","Ограничено поставщиками OAuth GitHub и Microsoft","Требуется совместимость с периферийной средой"],"ar":["يتطلب تكوينات رأس محددة","يقتصر على موفري GitHub و Microsoft OAuth","يتطلب التوافق مع بيئة Edge"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"75affa91dcec597c0b04ac93e5d3f91aa4ff91a3e266deacc2d61f8e537021fa","qualityScore":33}');
