одительности","Оптимизация размера пакета и времени загрузки"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء لتطبيقات ري액ت و نيكست.جس","نصائح لكتابة المكونات ري액ت","تنفيذ بحث البيانات على جانب العميل و الخادم","إعادة هيكلة الكود لتحسين الأداء","تحسين حجم الحزمة و وقت التحميل"]},"keywords":{"en":["react best practices guide","how to optimize react performance","next.js performance optimization","react-best-practices alternative","react-best-practices setup guide","react-best-practices vs webpack"],"zh":["React 优化","Next.js 优化","React 性能优化","代码审查","重构","数据获取优化","Bundle 大小优化","加载时间优化"],"ja":["React 最適化","Next.js 最適化","React パフォーマンス最適化","コードレビュー","リファクタリング","データ取得の最適化","バンドルサイズの最適化","ロード時間の最適化"],"ko":["React 최적화","Next.js 최적화","React 성능 최적화","코드 리뷰","리팩토링","데이터 가져오기 최적화","번들 크기 최적화","로드 시간 최적화"],"es":["mejores prácticas react","optimización de rendimiento react","next.js rendimiento","fetching de datos react","refactorización de código react","guía de rendimiento react"],"fr":["meilleures pratiques react","optimisation des performances react","next.js performances","fetching de données react","refactorisation de code react","guide de performances react"],"de":["beste Praktiken react","Leistungsverbesserung react","next.js Leistung","Datenabruf react","Refaktorisierung von Code react","Leitfaden für React-Performance"],"pt":["melhores práticas react","otimização de desempenho react","react performance optimization","next.js performance","desenvolvimento de aplicações react","react best practices","guias de otimização react"],"ru":["лучшие практики react","оптимизация производительности react","react производительность оптимизация","next.js производительность","разработка приложений react","react лучшие практики","руководства по оптимизации react"],"ar":["أفضل الممارسات لري액ت","تحسين الأداء لري액ت","ري액ت تحسين الأداء","نيكست.جس الأداء","تطوير تطبيقات ري액ت","ري액ت أفضل الممارسات","دلائل تحسين ري액ت"]}},"owner":"get-caio","repo":"harness","repoPath":"get-caio/harness","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.353Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","bodyPreview":"# React Best Practices\n\n## Overview\n\nPerformance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, ordered by impact. Apply these patterns when writing or reviewing code to maximize performance gains.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Priority-Ordered","body":"# React Best Practices\n\n## Overview\n\nPerformance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, ordered by impact. Apply these patterns when writing or reviewing code to maximize performance gains.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Priority-Ordered Guidelines\n\nRules are prioritized by impact:\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact |\n|----------|----------|--------|\n| 1 | Eliminating Waterfalls | CRITICAL |\n| 2 | Bundle Size Optimization | CRITICAL |\n| 3 | Server-Side Performance | HIGH |\n| 4 | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH |\n| 5 | Re-render Optimization | MEDIUM |\n| 6 | Rendering Performance | MEDIUM |\n| 7 | JavaScript Performance | LOW-MEDIUM |\n| 8 | Advanced Patterns | LOW |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Critical Patterns (Apply First)\n\n**Eliminate Waterfalls:**\n- Use `Promise.all()` for independent async operations\n- Start promises early, await late\n- Use `better-all` for partial dependencies\n- Use Suspense boundaries to stream content\n\n**Reduce Bundle Size:**\n- Avoid barrel file imports (import directly from source)\n- Use `next/dynamic` for heavy components\n- Defer non-critical third-party libraries\n- Preload based on user intent\n\n### High-Impact Server Patterns\n\n- Use `React.cache()` for per-request deduplication\n- Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- Minimize serialization at RSC boundaries\n- Parallelize data fetching with component composition\n\n### Medium-Impact Client Patterns\n\n- Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- Defer state reads to usage point\n- Use derived state subscriptions\n- Apply `startTransition` for non-urgent updates\n\n## References\n\nFull documentation with code examples is available in:\n\n- `references/react-performance-guidelines.md` - Complete guide with all patterns\n- `references/rules/` - Individual rule files organized by category\n\nTo look up a specific pattern, grep the rules directory:\n```\ngrep -l \"suspense\" references/rules/\ngrep -l \"barrel\" references/rules/\ngrep -l \"swr\" references/rules/\n```\n\n## Rule Categories in `references/rules/`\n\n- `async-*` - Waterfall elimination patterns\n- `bundle-*` - Bundle size optimization\n- `server-*` - Server-side performance\n- `client-*` - Client-side data fetching\n- `rerender-*` - Re-render optimization\n- `rendering-*` - DOM rendering performance\n- `js-*` - JavaScript micro-optimizations\n- `advanced-*` - Advanced patterns\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:57.323Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced React and Next.js performance optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 React 和 Next.js 性能优化能力的前端代理。","ja":"React と Next.js の高度なパフォーマンス最適化機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 React 및 Next.js 성능 최적화 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de optimización de rendimiento de React y Next.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de capacités avancées d''optimisation des performances de React et Next.js.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte Leistungs-Optimierungs-Funktionen für React und Next.js benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes Frontend que precisam de capacidades avançadas de otimização de desempenho do React e do Next.js.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности оптимизации производительности React и Next.js.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكلاء الواجهة الأمامية التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتحسين أداء React و Next.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply priority-ordered performance optimization patterns to React and Next.js applications, maximizing gains when writing or reviewing code, and optimizing bundle size or load times using React and Next.js protocols.","zh":"赋予代理应用优先排序的性能优化模式以最大化 React 和 Next.js 应用程序的收益，并在编写或审查代码时优化包大小或加载时间，使用 React 和 Next.js 协议。","ja":"エージェントに React と Next.js アプリケーションに優先順位のあるパフォーマンス最適化パターンを適用し、コードの作成またはレビュー時に React と Next.js のプロトコルを使用してバンドルサイズまたはロード時間を最適化して利益を最大化する機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트에게 React 및 Next.js 애플리케이션에 우선 순위가 지정된 성능 최적화 패턴을 적용하여 코드를 작성 또는 검토할 때 React 및 Next.js 프로토콜을 사용하여 번들 크기 또는 로드 시간을 최적화하여 이익을最大화하는 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar patrones de optimización de rendimiento ordenados por prioridad a aplicaciones de React y Next.js, maximizando los beneficios al escribir o revisar código y optimizar el tamaño del paquete o los tiempos de carga utilizando los protocolos de React y Next.js.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des modèles d''optimisation des performances classés par ordre de priorité aux applications React et Next.js, maximisant les gains lors de l''écriture ou de la révision du code et en optimisant la taille du paquet ou les temps de chargement à l''aide des protocoles React et Next.js.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, leistungs-optimierte Muster in der Reihenfolge der Priorität auf React- und Next.js-Anwendungen anzuwenden, um die Gewinne beim Schreiben oder Überprüfen von Code und Optimieren der Bundle-Größe oder Ladezeiten unter Verwendung der React- und Next.js-Protokolle zu maximieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar padrões de otimização de desempenho ordenados por prioridade para aplicações React e Next.js, maximizando os ganhos ao escrever ou revisar código e otimizando o tamanho do pacote ou os tempos de carregamento usando os protocolos React e Next.js.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью применять шаблоны оптимизации производительности в порядке приоритета для приложений React и Next.js, максимизируя выгоды при написании или просмотре кода и оптимизации размера пакета или времени загрузки с использованием протоколов React и Next.js.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من تطبيق أنماط تحسين الأداء المرتبة حسب الأولوية لتطبيقات React و Next.js، وتحقيق أقصى استفادة عند كتابة أو مراجعة الشفرة وتحسين حجم الحزمة أو أوقات التحميل باستخدام بروتوكولات React و Next.js."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing React component rendering for better performance","Implementing efficient data fetching strategies for client or server-side rendering","Refactoring existing React or Next.js code for improved load times and bundle size"],"zh":["为更好的性能优化 React 组件渲染","为客户端或服务器端渲染实现高效的数据获取策略","重构现有的 React 或 Next.js 代码以提高加载时间和包大小"],"ja":["より良いパフォーマンスのために React コンポーネントのレンダリングを最適化する","クライアント側またはサーバー側のレンダリングのための効率的なデータ取得戦略を実装する","既存の React または Next.js コードを読み込み時間とバンドルサイズの向上のためにリファクタリングする"],"ko":["より 좋은 성능을 위해 React 컴포넌트 렌더링을 최적화하는 것","클라이언트 측 또는 서버 측 렌더링을 위한 효율적인 데이터 가져오기 전략을 구현하는 것","로드 시간 및 번들 크기 개선을 위해 기존 React 또는 Next.js 코드를 리팩토링하는 것"],"es":["Optimizar el renderizado de componentes de React para un mejor rendimiento","Implementar estrategias de obtención de datos eficientes para renderizado del lado del cliente o del servidor","Reorganizar el código existente de React o Next.js para tiempos de carga y tamaño de paquete mejorados"],"fr":["Optimiser le rendu de composants React pour de meilleures performances","Mettre en œuvre des stratégies d''obtention de données efficaces pour le rendu côté client ou côté serveur","Réorganiser le code existant de React ou Next.js pour améliorer les temps de chargement et la taille du paquet"],"de":["Optimieren des Renderings von React-Komponenten für eine bessere Leistung","Implementieren effizienter Datenabruftaktiken für Client- oder Server-Seitige Rendering","Neuorganisieren des bestehenden React- oder Next.js-Codes für verbesserte Ladezeiten und Bundle-Größe"],"pt":["Otimizar a renderização de componentes React para melhor desempenho","Implementar estratégias de busca de dados eficientes para renderização de cliente ou servidor","Refatorar o código existente do React ou do Next.js para melhorar os tempos de carregamento e o tamanho do pacote"],"ru":["Оптимизировать рендеринг компонентов React для лучшей производительности","Реализовать эффективные стратегии поиска данных для рендеринга на стороне клиента или сервера","Пересмотреть существующий код React или Next.js для улучшения времени загрузки и размера пакета"],"ar":["تحسين تقديم مكونات React لتحقيق أداء أفضل","تنفيذ استراتيجيات بحث بيانات فعالة للعرض على جانب العميل أو الخادم","إعادة هيكلة الشفرة الحالية ل React أو Next.js لتحسين أوقات التحميل وحجم الحزمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React and Next.js ecosystems","Limited to React and Next.js applications only"],"zh":["需要了解 React 和 Next.js 生态系统","仅限于 React 和 Next.js 应用程序"],"ja":["React と Next.js のエコシステムを理解する必要がある","React と Next.js アプリケーションにのみ適用可能"],"ko":["React 및 Next.js 생태계를 이해해야 함","React 및 Next.js 애플리케이션에만 적용 가능"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de los ecosistemas de React y Next.js","Limitado a aplicaciones de React y Next.js solamente"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance des écosystèmes de React et Next.js","Limité aux applications React et Next.js uniquement"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der React- und Next.js-Ökosysteme","Begrenzt auf React- und Next.js-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento dos ecossistemas do React e do Next.js","Limitado a aplicações React e Next.js apenas"],"ru":["Требует знания экосистем React и Next.js","Ограничен только приложениями React и Next.js"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة ببيئات React و Next.js","محدود بتطبيقات React و Next.js فقط"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"912fc8bea6f2167a77efbd4438b512decee15b2dd665fbc971956922b3bde330","qualityScore":33}');
