mit Recharts - Best Practices","pt":"Guia de Implementação de Gráficos com Recharts","ru":"Настройка графиков с помощью Recharts - ИИ Агенты","ar":"دليل تنفيذ الرسوم البيانية مع Recharts - أدوات الذكاء الا..."},"description":{"en":"Unlock data visualization with chart-implementation. Learn how to use Recharts via shadcn/ui for SG Cars Trends backend services. Get started now!","zh":"学习如何使用Recharts和CSS变量实现数据可视化，并了解monorepo的SG Cars Trends后端服务","ja":"RechartsとCSS変数を使用してデータ可視化を実現する方法を学び、monorepoのSG Cars Trendsバックエンドサービスについて調べる","ko":"Recharts와 CSS 변수를 사용하여 데이터 시각화를 구현하는 방법을 배우고 monorepo의 SG Cars Trends 백엔드 서비스에 대해 알아보세요","es":"Aprende a implementar gráficos con Recharts en tu proyecto de monorepo para servicios de backend de SG Cars Trends","fr":"Découvrez comment mettre en œuvre des graphiques avec Recharts dans votre projet de monorepo pour les services de backend de SG Cars Trends","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Charts mit Recharts in Ihrem Monorepo-Projekt für SG Cars Trends-Backend-Dienste umsetzen","pt":"Aprenda a implementar gráficos com Recharts em seu projeto, utilizando CSS variables e o componente ChartContainer","ru":"Узнайте, как настроить графики с помощью Recharts, используя CSS-переменные и компонент ChartContainer - ИИ Агенты","ar":"تعلم كيفية تنفيذ الرسوم البيانية مع Recharts، باستخدام متغيرات CSS ومكون ChartContainer - أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"definition":{"en":"chart-implementation is a monorepo skill that uses Recharts via shadcn/ui for data visualization, following a core pattern with ChartContainer and ChartWidget.","zh":"图表实现是使用Recharts和CSS变量来实现数据可视化的方法","ja":"チャート実装とは、RechartsとCSS変数を使用してデータ可視化を実現する方法です","ko":"차트 구현은 Recharts와 CSS 변수를 사용하여 데이터 시각화를 구현하는 방법입니다","es":"La implementación de gráficos es una habilidad que utiliza Recharts para la visualización de datos","fr":"La mise en œuvre de graphiques est une compétence qui utilise Recharts pour la visualisation de données","de":"Die Umsetzung von Charts ist eine Fähigkeit, die Recharts für die Datenvisualisierung verwendet","pt":"Implementação de gráficos é uma técnica de visualização de dados que utiliza bibliotecas como Recharts","ru":"Настройка графиков - это техника визуализации данных, использующая библиотеки seperti Recharts - ИИ Агенты","ar":"تنفيذ الرسوم البيانية هو تقنية للرؤية البيانية للبيانات التي تستخدم مكتبات مثل Recharts - أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"features":{"en":["Uses Recharts via shadcn/ui for data visualization","Employs ChartContainer from @sgcarstrends/ui/components/chart","Wraps charts in ChartWidget from @web/components/charts/widget","Utilizes CSS variables for colors via design-language-system skill","Avoids direct use of raw ResponsiveContainer"],"zh":["使用Recharts实现数据可视化","使用CSS变量定义颜色","集成ChartContainer和ChartWidget组件","支持monorepo的SG Cars Trends后端服务","使用ResponsiveContainer的封装"],"ja":["Rechartsを使用してデータ可視化を実現","CSS変数を使用して色を定義","ChartContainerとChartWidgetコンポーネントを統合","monorepoのSG Cars Trendsバックエンドサービスをサポート","ResponsiveContainerのラッパーを使用"],"ko":["Recharts를 사용하여 데이터 시각화를 구현","CSS 변수를 사용하여 색을 정의","ChartContainer와 ChartWidget 컴포넌트를 통합","monorepo의 SG Cars Trends 백엔드 서비스를 지원","ResponsiveContainer의 래퍼를 사용"],"es":["Utiliza Recharts para la visualización de datos","Incorpora CSS variables para colores","Utiliza ChartContainer de @sgcarstrends/ui/components/chart","Wrap de ChartWidget de @web/components/charts/widget","Evita el uso directo de ResponsiveContainer"],"fr":["Utilise Recharts pour la visualisation de données","Intègre des variables CSS pour les couleurs","Utilise ChartContainer de @sgcarstrends/ui/components/chart","Wrap de ChartWidget de @web/components/charts/widget","Évite l''utilisation directe de ResponsiveContainer"],"de":["Verwendet Recharts für die Datenvisualisierung","Integriert CSS-Variablen für Farben","Verwendet ChartContainer von @sgcarstrends/ui/components/chart","Wrap von ChartWidget von @web/components/charts/widget","Vermeidet die direkte Verwendung von ResponsiveContainer"],"pt":["Utiliza Recharts para visualização de dados","Emprega CSS variables para cores","Componente ChartContainer para gráficos","Integração com shadcn/ui","Utiliza ChartWidget para gráficos responsivos"],"ru":["Использует Recharts для визуализации данных","Использует CSS-переменные для цветов","Компонент ChartContainer для графиков","Интеграция с shadcn/ui","Использует ChartWidget для графиков с адаптивным дизайном"],"ar":["يستخدم Recharts للرؤية البيانية للبيانات","يستخدم متغيرات CSS للألوان","مكون ChartContainer للرسوم البيانية","التكامل مع shadcn/ui","يستخدم ChartWidget للرسوم البيانية التفاعلية"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use chart-implementation","chart-implementation alternative","chart-implementation setup guide","Recharts data visualization","SG Cars Trends backend services","chart-implementation vs D3.js","chart-implementation install","what is chart-implementation"],"zh":["Recharts","CSS变量","数据可视化","monorepo","SG Cars Trends","后端服务","AIエージェント","图表实现"],"ja":["Recharts","CSS変数","データ可視化","monorepo","SG Cars Trends","バックエンドサービス","AIエージェント","チャート実装"],"ko":["Recharts","CSS 변수","데이터 시각화","monorepo","SG Cars Trends","백엔드 서비스","AI 에이전트","차트 구현"],"es":["implementación de gráficos","Recharts","monorepo","SG Cars Trends","visualización de datos","CSS variables","ChartContainer","ChartWidget"],"fr":["mise en œuvre de graphiques","Recharts","monorepo","SG Cars Trends","visualisation de données","variables CSS","ChartContainer","ChartWidget"],"de":["Umsetzung von Charts","Recharts","Monorepo","SG Cars Trends","Datenvisualisierung","CSS-Variablen","ChartContainer","ChartWidget"],"pt":["implementação de gráficos","Recharts","CSS variables","ChartContainer","shadcn/ui","visualização de dados","gráficos responsivos","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["настройка графиков","Recharts","CSS-переменные","ChartContainer","shadcn/ui","визуализация данных","грифики с адаптивным дизайном","разработка веб-приложений","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["تنفيذ الرسوم البيانية","Recharts","متغيرات CSS","مكون ChartContainer","shadcn/ui","الرؤية البيانية للبيانات","الرسوم البيانية التفاعلية","تطوير الويب","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"sgcarstrends","repo":"sgcarstrends","repoPath":"sgcarstrends/sgcarstrends","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.357Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"chart-implementation","description":"Create interactive charts for car registration and COE data visualization using Recharts. Use when adding new chart types, fixing chart bugs, or implementing data visualizations.","bodyPreview":"# Chart Implementation Skill\n\nUses **Recharts** via shadcn/ui `ChartContainer` for data visualization. Always use CSS variables for colors (see `design-language-system` skill).\n\n## Core Pattern\n\nAll charts use `ChartContainer` from `@sgcarstrends/ui/components/chart` wrapped in `ChartWidget` from `@web/components/charts/widget`. **Never use raw `ResponsiveContainer` directly.**\n\n```tsx\n\"use client\";\n\nimport {\n  ChartContainer,\n  ChartTooltip,\n  ChartTooltipContent,\n} from \"@sgcarstrends/ui/compo","body":"# Chart Implementation Skill\n\nUses **Recharts** via shadcn/ui `ChartContainer` for data visualization. Always use CSS variables for colors (see `design-language-system` skill).\n\n## Core Pattern\n\nAll charts use `ChartContainer` from `@sgcarstrends/ui/components/chart` wrapped in `ChartWidget` from `@web/components/charts/widget`. **Never use raw `ResponsiveContainer` directly.**\n\n```tsx\n\"use client\";\n\nimport {\n  ChartContainer,\n  ChartTooltip,\n  ChartTooltipContent,\n} from \"@sgcarstrends/ui/components/chart\";\nimport { ChartWidget } from \"@web/components/charts/widget\";\nimport { BarChart, Bar, CartesianGrid, XAxis, YAxis } from \"recharts\";\n\nexport function TopMakesChart({ data }: { data: { make: string; count: number }[] }) {\n  const chartConfig = {\n    count: { label: \"Count\", color: \"var(--chart-1)\" },\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <ChartWidget title=\"Top Makes\" isEmpty={data.length === 0}>\n      <ChartContainer config={chartConfig} className=\"h-[300px] w-full\">\n        <BarChart data={data}>\n          <CartesianGrid vertical={false} strokeDasharray=\"3 3\" className=\"stroke-default-200\" />\n          <XAxis dataKey=\"make\" tickLine={false} axisLine={false} className=\"text-xs\" />\n          <YAxis tickLine={false} axisLine={false} className=\"text-xs\" />\n          <ChartTooltip content={<ChartTooltipContent />} />\n          <Bar dataKey=\"count\" fill=\"var(--chart-1)\" radius={[8, 8, 0, 0]} />\n        </BarChart>\n      </ChartContainer>\n    </ChartWidget>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## ChartContainer\n\n`ChartContainer` wraps Recharts'' `ResponsiveContainer` with theming support. Set dimensions via CSS class on the container:\n\n```tsx\n// ✅ Correct - height via className\n<ChartContainer config={chartConfig} className=\"h-[300px] w-full\">\n  <BarChart data={data}>...</BarChart>\n</ChartContainer>\n\n// ❌ Wrong - raw ResponsiveContainer\n<ResponsiveContainer width=\"100%\" height={400}>\n  <BarChart data={data}>...</BarChart>\n</ResponsiveContainer>\n```\n\n### Width/Height -1 Warning\n\nRecharts `ResponsiveContainer` logs `width(-1) and height(-1)` warnings on first render before `ResizeObserver` fires. Fix by setting `initialDimension` on `ResponsiveContainer` in `packages/ui/src/components/chart.tsx`:\n\n```tsx\n<RechartsPrimitive.ResponsiveContainer initialDimension={{ width: 0, height: 400 }}>\n  {children}\n</RechartsPrimitive.ResponsiveContainer>\n```\n\nReference: [shadcn/ui PR #8486](https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui/pull/8486), [recharts #6716](https://github.com/recharts/recharts/issues/6716)\n\n## ChartWidget\n\nWraps charts in a Card with title, subtitle, empty state, and entrance animation:\n\n```tsx\n<ChartWidget\n  title=\"Registration Trends\"\n  subtitle=\"Monthly breakdown\"\n  isEmpty={data.length === 0}\n  emptyMessage=\"No trend data available\"\n>\n  <ChartContainer ...>...</ChartContainer>\n</ChartWidget>\n```\n\n## Chart Config\n\nDefine chart config for theming and legend/tooltip labels:\n\n```tsx\nconst chartConfig = {\n  diesel: { label: \"Diesel\", color: \"var(--chart-1)\" },\n  petrol: { label: \"Petrol\", color: \"var(--chart-2)\" },\n  electric: { label: \"Electric\", color: \"var(--chart-3)\" },\n};\n```\n\n## Performance\n\n### Memoize Data and Config\n\n```typescript\nconst chartConfig = useMemo(() => {\n  return Object.fromEntries(\n    categories.map((category, index) => [\n      category,\n      { label: category, color: `var(--chart-${index + 1})` },\n    ]),\n  );\n}, [categories]);\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **ChartContainer** - Always use `ChartContainer` with `className=\"h-[300px] w-full\"` (never raw `ResponsiveContainer`)\n2. **ChartWidget** - Wrap in `ChartWidget` for consistent card layout and empty states\n3. **CSS Variables** - Use `var(--chart-N)` for colors (1-6 available)\n4. **Axis styling** - Use `tickLine={false} axisLine={false} className=\"text-xs\"` for clean axes\n5. **Grid** - Use `<CartesianGrid vertical={false} strokeDasharray=\"3 3\" className=\"stroke-default-200\" />`\n6. **Tooltips** - Use shadcn `<ChartTooltip content={<ChartTooltipContent />} />`\n7. **Memoize** - Use `useMemo` for chart config and data transformations\n\n## References\n\n- Recharts: Use Context7 for latest docs\n- Design Language System: See `design-language-system` skill for colors\n- Chart component source: `packages/ui/src/components/chart.tsx`\n- Widget component: `apps/web/src/components/charts/widget.tsx`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:04:04.261Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing efficient data visualization capabilities with Recharts","zh":"适合需要使用Recharts进行高效数据可视化的前端代理","ja":"Rechartsを使用した効率的なデータ視覚化機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに適しています","ko":"Recharts를 사용하여 효율적인 데이터 시각화를 필요로 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades de visualización de datos eficientes con Recharts","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de capacités de visualisation de données efficaces avec Recharts","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die effiziente Datenvisualisierungsfähigkeiten mit Recharts benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades de visualização de dados eficientes com Recharts","ru":"Идеально для фронтенд-агентов, которым необходимы эффективные возможности визуализации данных с помощью Recharts","ar":"مثالي لعميل الواجهة الأمامية الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات مرئية للبيانات فعالة مع Recharts"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create interactive and responsive charts using Recharts via shadcn/ui, with seamless integration of CSS variables for customizable colors and the ability to wrap charts in ChartWidget from @web/components/charts/widget for enhanced presentation","zh":"赋予代理创建交互式和响应式图表的能力，使用shadcn/ui中的Recharts，通过CSS变量实现可自定义颜色，并可以使用@web/components/charts/widget中的ChartWidget进行包装以增强呈现","ja":"エージェントがshadcn/uiのRechartsを使用してインタラクティブなチャートとレスポンシブなチャートを作成できるようにし、CSS変数を使用してカスタマイズ可能な色を実現し、@web/components/charts/widgetのChartWidgetでチャートをラップしてプレゼンテーションを強化する","ko":"에이전트가 shadcn/ui의 Recharts를 사용하여 상호 작용형 및 반응형 차트를 생성할 수 있도록 하여 CSS 변수를 사용하여 사용자 지정 색상을实现하고 @web/components/charts/widget의 ChartWidget로 차트를 감싸서 표현을 강화합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear gráficos interactivos y responsivos usando Recharts a través de shadcn/ui, con integración sin problemas de variables CSS para colores personalizables y la capacidad de envolver gráficos en ChartWidget desde @web/components/charts/widget para una presentación mejorada","fr":"Autorise les agents à créer des graphiques interactifs et réactifs en utilisant Recharts via shadcn/ui, avec une intégration transparente des variables CSS pour des couleurs personnalisables et la possibilité d''encapsuler les graphiques dans ChartWidget depuis @web/components/charts/widget pour une présentation améliorée","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, interaktive und responsieve Charts mit Recharts über shadcn/ui zu erstellen, mit nahtloser Integration von CSS-Variablen für anpassbare Farben und die Fähigkeit, Charts in ChartWidget von @web/components/charts/widget für eine verbesserte Präsentation zu verpacken","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar gráficos interativos e responsivos usando Recharts via shadcn/ui, com integração perfeita de variáveis CSS para cores personalizáveis e a capacidade de embrulhar gráficos em ChartWidget do @web/components/charts/widget para apresentação aprimorada","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать интерактивные и респонсивные графики с помощью Recharts через shadcn/ui, с бесшовной интеграцией переменных CSS для настраиваемых цветов и возможностью обёртывать графики в ChartWidget из @web/components/charts/widget для улучшенной презентации","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بخلق مخططات تفاعلية ومتجاوبة باستخدام Recharts عبر shadcn/ui ، مع دمج متواصل للمتغيرات CSS لألوان قابلة للتعديل وقدرة على تغليف المخططات في ChartWidget من @web/components/charts/widget لتعزيز العرض"},"useCases":{"en":["Visualizing data trends with Recharts","Generating responsive charts for web applications","Customizing chart colors using CSS variables"],"zh":["使用Recharts可视化数据趋势","为Web应用程序生成响应式图表","使用CSS变量自定义图表颜色"],"ja":["Rechartsを使用してデータの傾向を視覚化する","Webアプリケーション用のレスポンシブなチャートを生成する","CSS変数を使用してチャートの色をカスタマイズする"],"ko":["Recharts를 사용하여 데이터 趨勢를 시각화하는 것","웹 애플리케이션을 위한 반응형 차트를 생성하는 것","CSS 변수를 사용하여 차트 색상을 사용자 지정하는 것"],"es":["Visualización de tendencias de datos con Recharts","Generación de gráficos responsivos para aplicaciones web","Personalización de colores de gráficos usando variables CSS"],"fr":["Visualisation de tendances de données avec Recharts","Génération de graphiques réactifs pour les applications web","Personnalisation des couleurs de graphiques en utilisant des variables CSS"],"de":["Visualisierung von Datentrends mit Recharts","Erzeugung responsiver Charts für Webanwendungen","Anpassung von Chartfarben unter Verwendung von CSS-Variablen"],"pt":["Visualizar tendências de dados com Recharts","Gerar gráficos responsivos para aplicações web","Personalizar cores de gráficos usando variáveis CSS"],"ru":["Визуализация тенденций данных с помощью Recharts","Генерация респонсивных графиков для веб-приложений","Настройка цветов графиков с помощью переменных CSS"],"ar":["تصوير اتجاهات البيانات مع Recharts","генерация مخططات متجاوبة للتطبيقات الويب","تخصيص ألوان المخططات باستخدام متغيرات CSS"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires @sgcarstrends/ui and @web/components installation","Must use ChartContainer from @sgcarstrends/ui/components/chart and ChartWidget from @web/components/charts/widget"],"zh":["需要安装@sgcarstrends/ui和@web/components","必须使用@sgcarstrends/ui/components/chart中的ChartContainer和@web/components/charts/widget中的ChartWidget"],"ja":["@sgcarstrends/uiと@web/componentsのインストールが必要","@sgcarstrends/ui/components/chartのChartContainerと@web/components/charts/widgetのChartWidgetを使用する必要がある"],"ko":["@sgcarstrends/ui와 @web/components 설치가 필요합니다","@sgcarstrends/ui/components/chart의 ChartContainer와 @web/components/charts/widget의 ChartWidget를 사용해야 합니다"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de @sgcarstrends/ui y @web/components","Debe utilizar ChartContainer desde @sgcarstrends/ui/components/chart y ChartWidget desde @web/components/charts/widget"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de @sgcarstrends/ui et @web/components","Doit utiliser ChartContainer depuis @sgcarstrends/ui/components/chart et ChartWidget depuis @web/components/charts/widget"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von @sgcarstrends/ui und @web/components","Muss ChartContainer von @sgcarstrends/ui/components/chart und ChartWidget von @web/components/charts/widget verwenden"],"pt":["Requer @sgcarstrends/ui e @web/components instalação","Deve usar ChartContainer de @sgcarstrends/ui/components/chart e ChartWidget de @web/components/charts/widget"],"ru":["Требует установки @sgcarstrends/ui и @web/components","Должно использовать ChartContainer из @sgcarstrends/ui/components/chart и ChartWidget из @web/components/charts/widget"],"ar":["يتطلب @sg