INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('sgcarstrends/sgcarstrends/chart-implementation', 'chart-implementation', 'sgcarstrends', 'sgcarstrends', 'community', 'chart-implementation sgcarstrends sgcarstrends community The chart-implementation skill utilizes Recharts for data visualization in SG Cars Trends backend services, benefiting developers with efficient charting capabilities. 本文介绍了使用Recharts和CSS变量实现数据可视化的方法，适用于SG Cars Trends后端服务的monorepo この記事では、RechartsとCSS変数を使用してデータ可視化を実現する方法を説明します。SG Cars Trendsバックエンドサービスのmonorepoに適しています 본 문서는 Recharts와 CSS 변수를 사용하여 데이터 시각화를 구현하는 방법을 설명하며 SG Cars Trends 백엔드 서비스의 monorepo에 적합합니다 Implementación de gráficos con Recharts en un monorepo para servicios de backend de SG Cars Trends Mise en œuvre de graphiques avec Recharts dans un monorepo pour les services de backend de SG Cars Trends Umsetzung von Charts mit Recharts in einem Monorepo für SG Cars Trends-Backend-Dienste A implementação de gráficos com Recharts é feita via shadcn/ui, utilizando o componente ChartContainer e CSS variables Настройка графиков с помощью Recharts осуществляется через shadcn/ui, используя компонент ChartContainer и CSS-переменные تنفيذ الرسوم البيانية مع Recharts يتم من خلال shadcn/ui، باستخدام مكون ChartContainer ومتغيرات CSS how to use chart-implementation chart-implementation alternative chart-implementation setup guide Recharts data visualization SG Cars Trends backend services chart-implementation vs D3.js chart-implementation install what is chart-implementation Recharts CSS变量 数据可视化 monorepo SG Cars Trends 后端服务 AIエージェント 图表实现 Uses Recharts via shadcn/ui for data visualization Employs ChartContainer from @sgcarstrends/ui/components/chart Wraps charts in ChartWidget from @web/components/charts/widget Utilizes CSS variables for colors via design-language-system skill Avoids direct use of raw ResponsiveContainer chart-implementation is a monorepo skill that uses Recharts via shadcn/ui for data visualization, following a core pattern with ChartContainer and ChartWidget.');
