для Практики Python: Руководство по Настройке","ar":"دليل ممارسة بايثون: تحديات بيانداس وخوارزميات"},"description":{"en":"Unlock pandas and algorithm practice challenges in Jupyter notebooks. Get started with python-practice today and boost your Python skills!","zh":"使用AIエージェント的Python Tutor功能，生成Jupyter笔记本，包含pandas和算法练习挑战","ja":"AIエージェントのPython Tutor機能を使用して、Pandasとアルゴリズムの練習チャレンジを含むJupyter Notebookを生成","ko":"AI 도구의 Python Tutor 기능을 사용하여 Pandas 및 알고리즘 연습 챌린지를 포함하는 Jupyter Notebook 생성","es":"Mejora tus habilidades en Python con desafíos de pandas y algoritmos. Genera un cuaderno de Jupyter con ejercicios prácticos","fr":"Améliorez vos compétences en Python avec des défis pandas et algorithmes. Générez un cahier Jupyter avec des exercices pratiques","de":"Verbessern Sie Ihre Fähigkeiten in Python mit Herausforderungen in pandas und Algorithmen. Erstellen Sie ein Jupyter-Notebook mit praktischen Übungen","pt":"Aprenda Python com desafios de pandas e algoritmos. Crie um notebook Jupyter personalizado com questões de manipulação de dados e estruturas de dados","ru":"Практикуйте Python с помощью задач по pandas и алгоритмам. Создайте индивидуальный блокнот Jupyter с вопросами по манипуляции данными и структурам данных","ar":"تعلم بايثون من خلال تحديات بيانداس وخوارزميات. أنشئ دفتر جupyter مخصصًا مع أسئلة عن معالجة البيانات وهيكل البيانات"},"definition":{"en":"python-practice is a skill that generates Jupyter notebooks filled with practice challenges and questions on pandas and algorithms.","zh":"Python实践是指使用Python语言进行数据操作和算法练习","ja":"Pythonプラクティスとは、Python言語を使用したデータ操作とアルゴリズムの練習","ko":"파이썬 연습은 파이썬 언어를 사용하여 데이터操作과 알고리즘을 연습하는 것을 의미","es":"Python-practice es una herramienta de práctica de Python que ofrece desafíos en pandas y algoritmos","fr":"Python-practice est un outil de pratique Python qui propose des défis en pandas et algorithmes","de":"Python-practice ist ein Tool für die Python-Praxis, das Herausforderungen in pandas und Algorithmen anbietet","pt":"O python-practice é um agente de prática Python que fornece desafios de pandas e algoritmos","ru":"ИИ Агент python-practice - это агент для практики Python, который предоставляет задачи по pandas и алгоритмам","ar":"وكلاء بايثون-مارس هو وكيل لممارسة بايثون الذي يوفر تحديات بيانداس وخوارزميات"},"features":{"en":["Generates Jupyter notebooks with practice challenges on pandas","Covers algorithms including vanilla Python data structures and recursion","Allows users to focus on specific categories or generate a random mix","Utilizes AskUserQuestion to gather parameters","Supports practice challenges on time series and data exploration"],"zh":["生成包含pandas练习挑战的Jupyter笔记本","包含算法练习挑战，例如排序和搜索","使用vanilla Python数据结构","支持时间序列数据操作","包含数据清理和探索练习挑战"],"ja":["Pandasの練習チャレンジを含むJupyter Notebookを生成","アルゴリズムの練習チャレンジを含む、例えばソートと検索","vanilla Pythonデータ構造を使用","時系列データ操作をサポート","データクリーンと探索の練習チャレンジを含む"],"ko":["Pandas 연습 챌린지를 포함하는 Jupyter Notebook 생성","알고리즘 연습 챌린지 포함, 예를 들어 정렬 및 검색","vanilla Python 데이터 구조 사용","시계열 데이터操作 지원","데이터 정리 및 탐색 연습 챌린지 포함"],"es":["Desafíos de pandas para la manipulación y limpieza de datos","Ejercicios de algoritmos con estructuras de datos de Python","Generación de cuadernos de Jupyter con ejercicios prácticos","Categorías de desafíos personalizables","Compatibilidad con Jupyter Notebook"],"fr":["Défis pandas pour la manipulation et le nettoyage de données","Exercices d''algorithmes avec des structures de données Python","Génération de cahiers Jupyter avec des exercices pratiques","Catégories de défis personnalisables","Compatibilité avec Jupyter Notebook"],"de":["Herausforderungen in pandas für die Datenmanipulation und -reinigung","Übungen mit Algorithmen und Python-Datenstrukturen","Erstellung von Jupyter-Notebooks mit praktischen Übungen","Anpassbare Herausforderungskategorien","Kompatibilität mit Jupyter Notebook"],"pt":["Geração de notebook Jupyter personalizado","Desafios de pandas para manipulação de dados","Desafios de algoritmos para estruturas de dados","Cobertura de tópicos como manipulação de dados, limpeza e exploração","Suporte a categorias personalizadas ou mistura aleatória","Integração com AskUserQuestion para parâmetros personalizados"],"ru":["Генерация индивидуального блокнота Jupyter","Задачи по pandas для манипуляции данными","Задачи по алгоритмам для структур данных","Покрытие тем, таких как манипуляция данными, очистка и исследование","Поддержка пользовательских категорий или случайной смеси","Интеграция с AskUserQuestion для пользовательских параметров"],"ar":["توليد دفتر جupyter مخصص","تحديات بيانداس لمعالجة البيانات","تحديات خوارزميات لهيكل البيانات","تغطية مواضيع مثل معالجة البيانات والتنظيف والاستكشاف","دعم الفئات المخصصة أو المزج العشوائي","التكامل مع AskUserQuestion لPARAMETERS المخصصة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use python-practice","python-practice setup guide","python-practice alternative","python-practice vs data science tutorials","python-practice install","python-practice for AI agents","pandas practice challenges","algorithm practice questions"],"zh":["Python实践","pandas练习","算法练习","Jupyter Notebook","数据操作","vanilla Python","AIエージェント","Python Tutor"],"ja":["Pythonプラクティス","Pandasの練習","アルゴリズムの練習","Jupyter Notebook","データ操作","vanilla Python","AIエージェント","Python Tutor"],"ko":["파이썬 연습","Pandas 연습","알고리즘 연습","Jupyter Notebook","데이터操作","vanilla Python","AI 도구","Python Tutor"],"es":["práctica de python","desafíos de pandas","algoritmos python","jupyter notebook","herramientas de python","aprendizaje de python","desarrollo de python","programación en python"],"fr":["pratique python","défis pandas","algorithmes python","jupyter notebook","outils python","apprentissage python","développement python","programmation python"],"de":["python-praxis","herausforderungen in pandas","algorithmen in python","jupyter notebook","python-tools","python-lernen","python-entwicklung","python-programmierung"],"pt":["prática python","desafios de pandas","algoritmos python","notebook jupyter","manipulação de dados","estruturas de dados","askuserquestion","categorias personalizadas","mista aleatória"],"ru":["практика python","задачи по pandas","алгоритмы python","блокнот jupyter","манипуляция данными","структуры данных","askuserquestion","пользовательские категории","случайная смесь"],"ar":["مارس بايثون","تحديات بيانداس","خوارزميات بايثون","دفتر جupyter","معالجة البيانات","هيكل البيانات","askuserquestion","فئات مخصصة","مزيج عشوائي"]}},"owner":"jwplatta","repo":"ml_gym","repoPath":"jwplatta/ml_gym","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.362Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"python-practice","description":"Generate Jupyter notebook practice challenges for Python. Use when the user wants practice problems, coding exercises, study notebooks, or drill questions for pandas or algorithms.","bodyPreview":"# Python Tutor\n\nGenerate a Jupyter notebook filled with practice challenges and questions. Challenges cover **pandas** (data manipulation, cleaning, exploration, time series) and **algorithms** (vanilla Python data structures, sorting, searching, recursion).\n\nFollow the rules in [RULES.md](RULES.md).\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Gather parameters** using AskUserQuestion. Ask the user:\n   - **Category**: Which category to focus on, or generate a random mix from all categories. Present the subcategories lis","body":"# Python Tutor\n\nGenerate a Jupyter notebook filled with practice challenges and questions. Challenges cover **pandas** (data manipulation, cleaning, exploration, time series) and **algorithms** (vanilla Python data structures, sorting, searching, recursion).\n\nFollow the rules in [RULES.md](RULES.md).\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Gather parameters** using AskUserQuestion. Ask the user:\n   - **Category**: Which category to focus on, or generate a random mix from all categories. Present the subcategories listed below.\n   - **Difficulty**: easy, medium, or hard.\n   - **Number of questions**: How many challenges to include (default 10).\n   - **Output directory**: Where to save the notebook. Default is `notebooks/practice`.\n   - **Previous exercises folder** (optional): Path to a folder containing previous practice notebooks. If provided, scan these notebooks to avoid repeating exact questions. You may generate the same *type* of question but must vary the data, parameters, or scenario to ensure uniqueness.\n\n2. **Check for previous exercises** (if folder provided):\n   - Scan notebooks in the previous exercises folder for question prompts.\n   - Extract the core challenge type from each (e.g., \"filter DataFrame by condition\", \"implement binary search\").\n   - When generating new questions, avoid repeating the exact same prompt. You may reuse the same question *type* but must change the data, column names, values, or scenario to make it fresh.\n\n3. **Generate varied question data** using the helper scripts (see [Scripts](#scripts) below). For every notebook:\n   - Run `random_tickers.py` to pick a fresh set of tickers for the session.\n   - Run `fetch_price_data.py` to get real market data for those tickers. Use the `--format code` or `--format returns` flag to get a Python snippet you can embed in the notebook setup cell.\n   - Run `random_data.py` to generate random numbers, date ranges, or messy DataFrames as needed by the questions.\n   - Vary the data in each question so notebooks are never identical.\n\n4. **Build the notebook** using `generate_notebook.py`:\n   - **Option A — from the question bank**: Use `--bank` to pull pre-written questions and randomize:\n     ```bash\n     python scripts/generate_notebook.py \\\n       --bank questions/bank.json \\\n       --category pandas --difficulty easy --count 5 \\\n       --output notebooks/practice\n     ```\n   - **Option B — custom questions**: Generate a JSON array of question objects and pipe to the script:\n     ```bash\n     python scripts/generate_notebook.py \\\n       --category pandas --difficulty medium \\\n       --output notebooks/practice < /tmp/questions.json\n     ```\n   - Each question object must have `prompt` (str) and `solution` (str). Optional fields:\n     - `hint` (str, will be rendered in a collapsed `<details>` tag). Hints must be hidden by default.\n     - `setup` (str, per-question code cell), `subcategory` (str).\n\n5. **Customize the setup cell** — replace the template''s sample data with the real market data fetched in step 3. Use the output of `fetch_price_data.py --format code` or `--format returns` as the setup cell content.\n\n6. **Confirm** the notebook path to the user when finished.\n\n## Notebook Structure\n\nEach generated notebook must follow this structure:\n\n1. **Title cell** (markdown): includes category, difficulty, date, and number of questions.\n2. **Setup cell** (code): import statements and sample datasets. For pandas notebooks, embed real market data fetched with `fetch_price_data.py`.\n3. **For each question**:\n   - A **markdown cell** with the challenge prompt, numbered (e.g. \"### Challenge 1\"). Include:\n     - A clear problem statement\n     - Any sample data or expected output\n     - When appropriate include a **hidden hint** wrapped in a `<details><summary>💡 Hint</summary>...</details>` tag (initially collapsed).\n   - An **empty code cell** for the user to write their solution.\n   - A **hidden solution cell** wrapped in a markdown `<details><summary>✅ Solution</summary>...</details>` tag so the user can reveal it.\n\n## Scripts\n\nAll scripts live in [scripts/](scripts/) and are run from that directory.\n\n### `generate_notebook.py`\nBuilds a `.ipynb` file from a category template + question data. Uses `nbformat`.\n\n```bash\n# From question bank:\npython scripts/generate_notebook.py --bank questions/bank.json \\\n  --category pandas --subcategory series --difficulty easy --count 5 --output notebooks/practice\n\n# From a JSON file of custom questions:\npython scripts/generate_notebook.py --questions /tmp/my_questions.json \\\n  --category algorithms --difficulty hard --output notebooks/practice\n\n# From stdin:\ncat questions.json | python scripts/generate_notebook.py --category pandas --output notebooks/practice\n```\n\n### `random_tickers.py`\nPick random ticker symbols to use in questions. Avoids repeating the same tickers.\n\n```bash\npython scripts/random_tickers.py --count 4                  # 4 random tickers\npython scripts/random_tickers.py --count 3 --sector tech    # from tech sector\npython scripts/random_tickers.py --count 5 --diverse        # one per sector\npython scripts/random_tickers.py --list-sectors              # show all sectors\n```\n\n**Use this every time** you generate a notebook to ensure fresh ticker sets.\n\n### `fetch_price_data.py`\nFetch real stock price data from Yahoo Finance via `yfinance`. Embed the output in notebook setup cells so students work with real market data.\n\n```bash\n# Get a code snippet to embed in the notebook\npython scripts/fetch_price_data.py --tickers AAPL MSFT TSLA --period 6mo --format code\n\n# Get daily returns as a code snippet\npython scripts/fetch_price_data.py --tickers AAPL MSFT --period 3mo --format returns\n\n# Random tickers + real data\npython scripts/fetch_price_data.py --random 4 --period 1y --format code\n\n# Save as CSV\npython scripts/fetch_price_data.py --tickers SPY QQQ --start 2023-01-01 --end 2024-01-01 --output prices.csv\n```\n\n### `random_data.py`\nGenerate random numbers, date ranges, names, and messy DataFrames for question variety.\n\n```bash\npython scripts/random_data.py --type integers --count 10 --min 1 --max 100\npython scripts/random_data.py --type floats --count 5 --min -0.05 --max 0.05\npython scripts/random_data.py --type date_range --start 2020-01-01 --periods 30 --freq B\npython scripts/random_data.py --type names --count 8\npython scripts/random_data.py --type messy_dataframe --rows 20\n```\n\nUse `--type messy_dataframe` to generate data-cleaning exercises with realistic problems (missing values, inconsistent casing, whitespace, bad types, duplicates).\n\n## Templates\n\nCategory-specific notebook templates live in [templates/](templates/). Each template provides:\n- A title cell with `{{difficulty}}`, `{{date}}`, `{{count}}`, `{{subcategories}}` placeholders\n- A setup cell with appropriate imports and sample datasets\n\n| Template | File | Description |\n|----------|------|-------------|\n| Pandas | `templates/pandas_template.ipynb` | Imports pandas, numpy, matplotlib, seaborn. Pre-built sample datasets (stock_returns, messy_data, sectors). |\n| Algorithms | `templates/algorithms_template.ipynb` | Imports collections, heapq, math, typing. Includes a `check()` helper for testing solutions. |\n\n## Question Bank\n\nPre-written questions are stored in [questions/bank.json](questions/bank.json). The bank is organized as:\n\n```\n{ category: { subcategory: { difficulty: [question, ...] } } }\n```\n\nEach question has: `prompt`, `solution`, and optionally `hint` and `setup`.\n\n## Categories and Subcategories\n\n### Pandas\n\nRefer to [references/PANDAS_NOTE.md](references/PANDAS_NOTE.md) for the topic tree and [references/PANDAS_FOR_DATA_SCIENCE.md](references/PANDAS_FOR_DATA_SCIENCE.md) for functions and techniques. Use [examples/PANDAS_EXAMPLES.md](examples/PANDAS_EXAMPLES.md) for sample data patterns.\n\nSubcategories:\n- **Series**: creation, retrieval, modification, alignment, built-in methods\n- **DataFrames**: retrieval (loc/iloc, slicing, boolean masks), modification, column operations\n- **Data exploration**: apply/applymap, correlations, covariance, DataFrame-Series arithmetic\n- **Missing data**: detection, dropping, filling, interpolation\n- **Reindexing and sorting**: reindex, drop, sort_index, sort_values\n- **Categorical data**: unique values, value_counts, isin, dummy variables\n- **File I/O**: reading/writing CSV, Excel, pickle\n- **Multi-indexing**: multi-index DataFrames and Series, stack/unstack, swaplevel\n- **Time series**: timestamps, offsets, date ranges, resampling, shifting\n- **GroupBy, pivot, merge**: groupby, pivot_table, merge/join, concat\n- **Rolling and quantiles**: rolling windows, qcut, shift for returns\n- **Plotting**: line, bar, scatter, histograms, heatmaps with seaborn\n\n### Algorithms\n\nFocused on vanilla Python (no external libraries).\n\nSubcategories:\n- **Data structures**: lists, dicts, sets, tuples, deques, heaps\n- **Sorting**: bubble, merge, quick, insertion sort implementations\n- **Searching**: linear search, binary search\n- **Recursion**: factorial, fibonacci, tree traversal, divide and conquer\n- **String manipulation**: reversal, palindromes, anagrams, pattern matching\n- **Math and logic**: primes, GCD, modular arithmetic, bit manipulation\n\n## Difficulty Levels\n\n- **Easy**: Single-concept problems. Provide hints and sample data. Expect 1-5 lines of code per solution.\n- **Medium**: Combine 2-3 concepts. Provide sample data but no hints. Expect 5-15 lines of code.\n- **Hard**: Multi-step problems requiring chaining operations or designing algorithms. No hints. Expect 10-30+ lines of code.\n\n## Additional Resources\n\n- For pandas topic details, see [references/PANDAS_NOTE.md](references/PANDAS_NOTE.md)\n- For pandas functions reference, see [references/PANDAS_FOR_DATA_SCIENCE.md](references/PANDAS_FOR_DATA_SCIENCE.md)\n- For numpy context, see [references/NUMPY.md](references/NUMPY.md)\n- For code examples and sample data, see [examples/PANDAS_EXAMPLES.md](examples/PANDAS_EXAMPLES.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:04:17.645Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python-focused AI Agents needing advanced data manipulation and algorithm practice capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级数据操作和算法实践能力的Python专注的AI代理。","ja":"Pythonに焦点を当てたAIエージェントが高度なデータ操作とアルゴリズムの実践能力を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 데이터 조작 및 알고리즘 실습 기능이 필요한 Python 중심의 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de inteligencia artificial enfocados en Python que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de manipulación de datos y práctica de algoritmos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle axés sur Python nécessitant des capacités avancées de manipulation de données et de pratique d''algorithmes.","de":"Perfekt für Python-fokussierte KI-Agents, die erweiterte Datenmanipulations- und Algorithmen-Praxisfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA focados em Python que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de manipulação de dados e prática de algoritmos.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на Python, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности манипуляции данными и практики алгоритмов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يركزون على Python والذين يحتاجون إلى قابليات متقدمة لتعديل البيانات وممارسة الخوارزميات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate comprehensive Jupyter notebooks filled with practice challenges for pandas data manipulation and vanilla Python algorithms, enhancing their data cleaning, exploration, and time series analysis skills using libraries like pandas.","zh":"使代理能够生成填充了pandas数据操作和纯Python算法的实践挑战的综合Jupyter笔记本，增强他们使用像pandas这样的库的数据清理、探索和时间序列分析能力。","ja":"エージェントがpandasのデータ操作とバニラPythonのアルゴリズムの実践課題で埋め尽された包括的なJupyterノートブックを生成できるようにし、pandasなどのライブラリを使用したデータのクリーンアップ、探索、時系列分析のスキルを高める。","ko":"에이전트가 판다스 데이터 조작 및 바닐라 파이썬 알고리즘의 실습 과제로 채워진 포괄적인 주피터 노트북을 생성할 수 있도록 하여, 판다스와 같은 라이브러리를 사용한 데이터 정리, 탐색 및 시계열 분석 기능을 향상시킵니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar cuadernos Jupyter integrales llenos de desafíos de práctica para la manipulación de datos pandas y algoritmos de Python vanilla, mejorando sus habilidades de limpieza de datos, exploración y análisis de series temporales utilizando bibliotecas como pandas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des cahiers Jupyter complets remplis de défis de pratique pour la manipulation de données pandas et les algorithmes Python vanilla, améliorant ainsi leurs compétences en matière de nettoyage de données, d''exploration et d''analyse de séries chronologiques à l''aide de bibliothèques telles que pandas.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, umfassende Jupyter-Notebooks mit Übungsaufgaben für pandas-Datenmanipulation und Vanilla-Python-Algorithmen zu generieren, wodurch ihre Fähigkeiten zur Datenbereinigung, -exploration und Zeitreihenanalyse unter Verwendung von Bibliotheken wie pandas verbessert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar notebooks Jupyter abrangentes cheios de desafios de prática para manipulação de dados pandas e algoritmos Python puro, melhorando suas habilidades de limpeza de dados, exploração e análise de séries temporais usando bibliotecas como pandas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать полные ноутбуки Jupyter, заполненные практическими задачами для манипуляции данными pandas и алгоритмов на чистом Python, повышая их навыки очистки данных, исследования и анализа временных рядов с использованием библиотек, таких как pandas.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء دفاتر ملاحظات Jupyter شاملة ممتلئة بتحديات تجريبية لتعديل البيانات pandas والخوارزميات Python الفانيلية، مما يعزز من مهاراتهم في تنظيف البيانات والاستكشاف وتحليل السلاسل الزمنية باستخدام مكتبات مثل pandas."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating practice challenges for data scientists","Creating interactive Jupyter notebooks for algorithm learning","Enhancing skills in pandas data manipulation and exploration"],"zh":["为数据科学家生成实践挑战","创建交互式Jupyter笔记本用于算法学习","提高pandas数据操作和探索能力"],"ja":["データサイエンティストのための実践課題の生成","アルゴリズムの学習のための対話型Jupyterノートブックの作成","pandasのデータ操作と探索のスキルの向上"],"ko":["데이터 과학자를 위한 실습 과제 생성","알고리즘 학습을 위한 인터랙티브 주피터 노트북 생성","판다스의 데이터 조작 및 탐색 능력 향상"],"es":["Generación de desafíos de práctica para científicos de datos","Creación de cuadernos Jupyter interactivos para el aprendizaje de algoritmos","Mejora de habilidades en manipulación y exploración de datos pandas"],"fr":["Génération de défis de pratique pour les scientifiques de données","Création de cahiers Jupyter interactifs pour l''apprentissage d''algorithmes","Amélioration des compétences en manipulation et exploration de données pandas"],"de":["Erzeugung von Übungsaufgaben für Data Scientists","Erstellung interaktiver Jupyter-Notebooks für Algorithmenlernen","Verbesserung der Fähigkeiten in pandas-Datenmanipulation und -exploration"],"pt":["Geração de desafios de prática para cientistas de dados","Criação de notebooks Jupyter interativos para aprendizado de algoritmos","Melhoria das habilidades em manipulação de dados pandas e exploração"],"ru":["Генерация практических задач для ученых-данных","Создание интерактивных ноутбуков Jupyter для изучения алгоритмов","Улучшение навыков манипуляции данными pandas и исследования"],"ar":["إنشاء تحديات تدريبية للعلماء البيانات","إنشاء دفاتر ملاحظات Jupyter التفاعلية لتعلم الخوارزميات","تحسين المهارات في تعديل البيانات pandas والاستكشاف"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Jupyter notebook compatibility","Focused on Python 3.x","Limited to data manipulation and algorithm challenges"],"zh":["需要Jupyter笔记本兼容性","专注于Python 3.x","仅限于数据操作和算法挑战"],"ja":["Jupyterノートブックの互換性が必要","Python 3.xに焦点を当てている","データ操作とアルゴリズムの課題のみ"],"ko":["주피터 노트북 호환성이 필요함","파이썬 3.x에 초점을 둠","데이터 조작 및 알고리즘 과제만 해당"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con cuadernos Jupyter","Enfocado en Python 3.x","Limitado a desafíos de manipulación y algoritmos de datos"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité des cahiers Jupyter","Axé sur Python 3.x","Limité aux défis de manipulation et d''algorithmes de données"],"de":["Benötigt Jupyter-Notebook-Kompatibilität","Fokussiert auf Python 3.x","Begrenzt auf Datenmanipulations- und Algorithmenherausforderungen"],"pt":["Requer compatibilidade com notebooks Jupyter","Focado em Python 3.x","Limitado a desafios de manipulação de dados e algoritmos"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с ноутбуками Jupyter","Ориентирован на Python 3.x","Ограничен задачами манипуляции данными и алгоритмов"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع دفاتر الملاحظات Jupyter","موجه إلى Python 3.x","محدود بتحديات تعديل البيانات والخوارزميات"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"8acb0a738ac21438a085a0bf4e75a513f7334bb0220b5fb7167351d1f2cfb5e3","qualityScore":33}'