de créer des vues personnalisées des données","de":"Die semantischen Ansichten von Snowflake sind Datenbankobjekte, die es Entwicklern ermöglichen, benutzerdefinierte Ansichten der Daten zu erstellen","pt":"O que é snowflake-semantic-views? É uma habilidade para criar e melhorar vistas semânticas no Snowflake","ru":"Что такое snowflake-semantic-views? Это ИИ Агент для создания и улучшения семантических представлений Snowflake","ar":"ما هي مهارة snowflake-semantic-views؟ هي مهارة لإنشاء وتحسين العروض الدلالية في Snowflake"},"features":{"en":["Verifies Snowflake CLI installation using `snow --help` command","Configures Snowflake connections with `snow connection add` command","Utilizes Snowflake documentation for connection configuration and CLI installation","Enhances Snowflake semantic views in SQL using Snowflake CLI","Supports one-time setup for Snowflake connections and semantic views"],"zh":["使用 Snowflake CLI 进行配置","创建和增强 SQL 语义视图","支持 Snowflake 连接配置","提供数据分析效率的提高"],"ja":["Snowflake CLI を使用して設定","SQL のセマンティックビューを作成して強化","Snowflake 接続の設定をサポート","データ分析の効率性を向上させる"],"ko":["Snowflake CLI를 사용하여 구성","SQL 의미 뷰를 생성하고 강화","Snowflake 연결 구성 지원","데이터 분석 효율성을 높임"],"es":["Configuración de la conexión de Snowflake con snow connection add","Verificación de la instalación de Snowflake CLI con snow --help","Creación de vistas semánticas personalizadas en SQL","Mejora de las vistas semánticas existentes","Uso de la configuración de Snowflake para conectar con la base de datos"],"fr":["Configuration de la connexion Snowflake avec snow connection add","Vérification de l''installation de Snowflake CLI avec snow --help","Création de vues sémantiques personnalisées en SQL","Amélioration des vues sémantiques existantes","Utilisation de la configuration Snowflake pour se connecter à la base de données"],"de":["Konfiguration der Snowflake-Verbindung mit snow connection add","Überprüfung der Snowflake-CLI-Installation mit snow --help","Erstellung benutzerdefinierter semantischer Ansichten in SQL","Verbesserung bestehender semantischer Ansichten","Verwendung der Snowflake-Konfiguration zum Verbinden mit der Datenbank"],"pt":["Criação de vistas semânticas no Snowflake","Melhoria de vistas semânticas existentes","Utilização do Snowflake CLI para configuração","Suporte à linguagem SQL","Configuração de conexão com o Snowflake","Utilização do comando `snow connection add`"],"ru":["Создание семантических представлений в Snowflake","Улучшение существующих семантических представлений","Использование Snowflake CLI для настройки","Поддержка языка SQL","Настройка подключения к Snowflake","Использование команды `snow connection add`"],"ar":["إنشاء عروض دلالية في Snowflake","تحسين العروض الدلالية الحالية","استخدام واجهة سطر أوامر Snowflake للاعداد","دعم لغة SQL","إعداد الاتصال بالSnowflake","استخدام الأمر `snow connection add`"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use snowflake-semantic-views","snowflake-semantic-views setup guide","snowflake-semantic-views alternative","snowflake-semantic-views vs snowsql","snowflake-semantic-views install","configuring snowflake connections","creating snowflake semantic views","snowflake cli installation"],"zh":["Snowflake 语义视图","Snowflake CLI","SQL 语义视图","数据分析","AIエージェント","Snowflake 设置"],"ja":["Snowflake セマンティックビュー","Snowflake CLI","SQL セマンティックビュー","データ分析","AIエージェント","Snowflake 設定"],"ko":["Snowflake 의미 뷰","Snowflake CLI","SQL 의미 뷰","데이터 분석","AI 에이전트","Snowflake 설정"],"es":["snowflake semantic views","configuración de snowflake","vistas semánticas en sql","snowflake cli","desarrollo de bases de datos","herramientas de desarrollo de snowflake","agentes de inteligencia artificial para desarrolladores","herramientas de ai para desarrolladores"],"fr":["snowflake semantic views","configuration de snowflake","vues sémantiques en sql","snowflake cli","développement de bases de données","outils de développement de snowflake","agents d''intelligence artificielle pour développeurs","outils d''ia pour développeurs"],"de":["snowflake semantic views","konfiguration von snowflake","semantische ansichten in sql","snowflake cli","entwicklung von datenbanken","entwicklertools für snowflake","künstliche intelligenz agenten für entwickler","künstliche intelligenz tools für entwickler"],"pt":["snowflake semantic views","criar vistas semânticas","melhorar vistas semânticas","snowflake cli","sql","configurar snowflake","conexão snowflake","snowflake tutorial"],"ru":["snowflake семантические представления","создать семантические представления","улучшить семантические представления","snowflake cli","sql","настроить snowflake","подключение snowflake","snowflake уроки"],"ar":["عروض دلالية snowflake","إنشاء عروض دلالية","تحسين العروض الدلالية","واجهة سطر أوامر snowflake","sql","إعداد snowflake","اتصال snowflake","دروس snowflake"]}},"owner":"MiguelElGallo","repo":"snowflake-semantic-view-skill","repoPath":"MiguelElGallo/snowflake-semantic-view-skill","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.372Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"snowflake-semantic-views","description":"Create, alter, and validate Snowflake semantic views using the Snowflake CLI (`snow`). Use when asked to build or troubleshoot semantic views or semantic layer definitions with CREATE/ALTER SEMANTIC VIEW, to validate semantic view DDL against Snowflake via the CLI, or to guide Snowflake CLI installation and connection setup.","bodyPreview":"# Snowflake Semantic Views\n\n## One-Time Setup\n\n- Verify the Snowflake CLI installation by opening a new terminal and running `snow --help`.\n- If the Snowflake CLI is missing or the user cannot install it, direct them to https://docs.snowflake.com/en/developer-guide/snowflake-cli/installation/installation.\n- Configure a Snowflake connection with `snow connection add` per https://docs.snowflake.com/en/developer-guide/snowflake-cli/connecting/configure-connections#add-a-connection.\n- Use the config","body":"# Snowflake Semantic Views\n\n## One-Time Setup\n\n- Verify the Snowflake CLI installation by opening a new terminal and running `snow --help`.\n- If the Snowflake CLI is missing or the user cannot install it, direct them to https://docs.snowflake.com/en/developer-guide/snowflake-cli/installation/installation.\n- Configure a Snowflake connection with `snow connection add` per https://docs.snowflake.com/en/developer-guide/snowflake-cli/connecting/configure-connections#add-a-connection.\n- Use the configured connection for all validation and execution steps.\n\n## Workflow For Each Semantic View Request\n\n1. Confirm the target database, schema, role, warehouse, and final semantic view name.\n2. Confirm the model follows a star schema (facts with conformed dimensions).\n3. Draft the semantic view DDL using the official syntax:\n   - https://docs.snowflake.com/en/sql-reference/sql/create-semantic-view\n4. Populate synonyms and comments for each dimension, fact, and metric:\n   - Read Snowflake table/view/column comments first (preferred source):\n     - https://docs.snowflake.com/en/sql-reference/sql/comment\n   - If comments or synonyms are missing, ask whether you can create them, whether the user wants to provide text, or whether you should draft suggestions for approval.\n5. Use a SELECT statement with DISTINCT and LIMIT (max 1,000 rows) to discover relationships between fact and dimension tables, identify column data types, and create more meaningful comments and synonyms for the columns.\n6. Create a temporary validation name (for example, append `__tmp_validate`) while keeping the same database and schema.\n7. Always validate by sending the DDL to Snowflake via the Snowflake CLI before finalizing:\n   - Use `snow sql` to execute the statement with the configured connection.\n   - If flags differ by version, check `snow sql --help` and use the connection option shown there.\n8. If validation fails, iterate on the DDL and re-run the validation step until it succeeds.\n9. Apply the final DDL (create or alter) using the real semantic view name.\n10. Run a sample query against the final semantic view to confirm it works as expected. Semantic views use a different SQL syntax, as shown here: https://docs.snowflake.com/en/user-guide/views-semantic/querying#querying-a-semantic-view\nExample:\n\n```SQL\nSELECT * FROM SEMANTIC_VIEW(\n    my_semview_name\n    DIMENSIONS customer.customer_market_segment\n    METRICS orders.order_average_value\n  )\n  ORDER BY customer_market_segment;\n```\n\n11. Clean up any temporary semantic view created during validation.\n\n## Synonyms and Comments (Required)\n\n- Use the semantic view syntax for synonyms and comments:\n\n```\nWITH SYNONYMS [ = ] ( ''synonym'' [ , ... ] )\nCOMMENT = ''comment_about_dim_fact_or_metric''\n```\n\n- Treat synonyms as informational only; do not use them to reference dimensions, facts, or metrics elsewhere.\n- Use Snowflake comments as the preferred and first source for synonyms and comments:\n  - https://docs.snowflake.com/en/sql-reference/sql/comment\n- If Snowflake comments are missing, ask whether you can create them, whether the user wants to provide text, or whether you should draft suggestions for approval.\n- Do not invent synonyms or comments without user approval.\n\n## Validation Pattern (Required)\n\n- Never skip validation. Always execute the DDL against Snowflake with the Snowflake CLI before presenting it as final.\n- Prefer a temporary name for validation to avoid clobbering the real view.\n\n## Example CLI Validation (Template)\n\n```bash\n# Replace placeholders with real values.\nsnow sql -q \"<CREATE OR ALTER SEMANTIC VIEW ...>\" --connection <connection_name>\n```\n\nIf the Snowflake CLI uses a different connection flag in your version, run:\n\n```bash\nsnow sql --help\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- Treat installation and connection setup as one-time steps, but confirm they are done before the first validation.\n- Keep the final semantic view definition identical to the validated temporary definition except for the name.\n- Do not omit synonyms or comments; consider them required for completeness even if optional in syntax.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:04:31.058Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Analysis Agents needing advanced Snowflake semantic view management capabilities in SQL.","zh":"适合需要高级Snowflake语义视图管理功能的数据分析代理，特别是在SQL中。","ja":"SQLにおける高度なSnowflakeセマンティックビュー管理機能を必要とするデータ分析エージェントに適しています。","ko":"SQL에서 고급 Snowflake 의미 체계 보기 관리 기능을 필요로 하는 데이터 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Análisis de Datos que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de gestión de vistas semánticas de Snowflake en SQL.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de données nécessitant des capacités avancées de gestion de vues sémantiques Snowflake en SQL.","de":"Perfekt für Data-Analytics-Agents, die erweiterte Snowflake semantische View-Management-Funktionen in SQL benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Dados que precisam de capacidades avançadas de gerenciamento de visões semânticas do Snowflake em SQL.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа данных, которым необходимы расширенные возможности управления семантическими представлениями Snowflake в SQL.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء تحليل البيانات الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لإدارة العرض الدلالي Snowflake في SQL."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to configure Snowflake connections, manage semantic views, and leverage the Snowflake CLI for streamlined data analysis, utilizing SQL and supporting protocols like snow connection add.","zh":"赋予代理配置Snowflake连接、管理语义视图以及利用Snowflake CLI进行流畅的数据分析的能力，使用SQL并支持诸如snow connection add的协议。","ja":"エージェントがSnowflake接続を構成し、セマンティックビューを管理し、Snowflake CLIを使用してスムーズなデータ分析を実行できるようにし、SQLおよびsnow connection addなどのプロトコルをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 Snowflake 연결을 구성하고 의미 체계 보기를 관리하며 Snowflake CLI를 사용하여 데이터 분석을 원활하게进行할 수 있도록 하며, SQL 및 snow connection add와 같은 프로토콜을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a configurar conexiones de Snowflake, gestionar vistas semánticas y aprovechar el CLI de Snowflake para un análisis de datos optimizado, utilizando SQL y protocolos compatibles como snow connection add.","fr":"Autonomise les agents pour configurer les connexions Snowflake, gérer les vues sémantiques et exploiter le CLI Snowflake pour une analyse de données optimisée, en utilisant SQL et des protocoles comme snow connection add.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Snowflake-Verbindungen zu konfigurieren, semantische Views zu verwalten und das Snowflake-CLI für einen optimierten Datenanalyse zu nutzen, unter Verwendung von SQL und unterstützten Protokollen wie snow connection add.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a configurar conexões do Snowflake, gerenciar visões semânticas e utilizar a CLI do Snowflake para análise de dados otimizada, utilizando SQL e protocolos de suporte como snow connection add.","ru":"Позволяет агентам настраивать подключения к Snowflake, управлять семантическими представлениями и использовать CLI Snowflake для оптимизированного анализа данных, используя SQL и поддерживаемые протоколы, такие как snow connection add.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تكوين اتصالات Snowflake وإدارة العروض الدلالية واستخدام واجهة سطر الأوامر Snowflake للتحليل البياني المتسلسل، باستخدام SQL وبروتوكولات الدعم مثل snow connection add."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring Snowflake connections for secure data access","Creating and enhancing Snowflake semantic views for improved data visualization","Debugging Snowflake CLI installations for seamless integration"],"zh":["配置Snowflake连接以实现安全的数据访问","创建和增强Snowflake语义视图以提高数据可视化","调试Snowflake CLI安装以实现无缝集成"],"ja":["セキュアなデータアクセスを実現するためのSnowflake接続の構成","データ視覚化の向上のためのSnowflakeセマンティックビューの作成と強化","シームレスな統合を実現するためのSnowflake CLIのインストールのデバッグ"],"ko":["보안 데이터 액세스를 위해 Snowflake 연결을 구성하기","데이터 시각화 향상을 위해 Snowflake 의미 체계 보기 만들기 및 향상하기","無縫な統合을 위해 Snowflake CLI 설치 디버깅하기"],"es":["Configuración de conexiones de Snowflake para un acceso de datos seguro","Creación y mejora de vistas semánticas de Snowflake para una mejor visualización de datos","Depuración de instalaciones de CLI de Snowflake para una integración sin problemas"],"fr":["Configuration des connexions Snowflake pour un accès sécurisé aux données","Création et amélioration des vues sémantiques Snowflake pour une meilleure visualisation des données","Débogage des installations du CLI Snowflake pour une intégration sans problème"],"de":["Konfiguration von Snowflake-Verbindungen für sicheren Datenzugriff","Erstellung und Verbesserung von Snowflake semantischen Views für eine verbesserte Datenvisualisierung","Fehlerbehebung von Snowflake-CLI-Installationen für eine nahtlose Integration"],"pt":["Configurar conexões do Snowflake para acesso de dados seguro","Criar e aprimorar visões semânticas do Snowflake para visualização de dados melhorada","Depurar instalações do Snowflake CLI para integração sem problemas"],"ru":["Настройка подключений к Snowflake для безопасного доступа к данным","Создание и совершенствование семантических представлений Snowflake для улучшения визуализации данных","Отладка установок Snowflake CLI для бесшовной интеграции"],"ar":["تكوين اتصالات Snowflake من أجل الوصول الآمن إلى البيانات","إنشاء وتحسين العروض الدلالية Snowflake من أجل تحسين تجسير البيانات","تصحيح أخطاء تثبيت واجهة سطر الأوامر Snowflake من أجل التكامل السلس"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Snowflake CLI installation","Needs active Snowflake account for connection configuration","Snowflake-specific, may not be compatible with other database systems"],"zh":["需要Snowflake CLI安装","需要活跃的Snowflake账户进行连接配置","特定于Snowflake，可能与其他数据库系统不兼容"],"ja":["Snowflake CLIのインストールが必要","接続の構成にはアクティブなSnowflakeアカウントが必要","Snowflake固有のため、他のデータベースシステムと互換性がない可能性がある"],"ko":["Snowflake CLI 설치가 필요합니다","연결 구성에는 활성 Snowflake 계정이 필요합니다","Snowflake 전용으로, 다른 데이터베이스 시스템과 호환되지 않을 수 있습니다"],"es":["Requiere instalación del CLI de Snowflake","Necesita una cuenta de Snowflake activa para la configuración de la conexión","Específico de Snowflake, puede que no sea compatible con otros sistemas de bases de datos"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation du CLI Snowflake","Nécessite un compte Snowflake actif pour la configuration de la connexion","Spécifique à Snowflake, peut ne pas être compatible avec d''autres systèmes de bases de données"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation des Snowflake-CLI","Benötigt ein aktives Snowflake-Konto für die Konfiguration der Verbindung","Snowflake-spezifisch, kann möglicherweise nicht mit anderen Datenbanksystemen kompatibel sein"],"pt":["Requer instalação da CLI do Snowflake","Necessita de conta ativa do Snowflake para configuração de conexão","Específico do Snowflake, pode não ser compatível com outros sistemas de banco de dados"],"ru":["Требует установки Snowflake CLI","Требует активного аккаунта Snowflake для настройки подключения","Специфичен для Snowflake, может быть несовместим с другими системами баз данных"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت واجهة سطر الأوامر Snowflake","يحتاج إلى حساب نشط Snowflake من أجل تكوين الاتصال","محدد لبرنامج Snowflake، قد لا يكون متوافقًا مع أنظمة قواعد البيانات الأخرى"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"18b9f013ff8c02eba6fe59d98a26af07ab0099168f834b21e3ab22f2553bdafb","qualityScore":33}');
