Flutter","intégration de l''historique du navigateur","développement d''applications mobiles","développement d''applications web","Flutter pour les développeurs"],"de":["Navigation in Flutter","Routing in Flutter","Navigator-API","Deep-Links","Datenverwaltung in Flutter","Integration der Browser-Historie","Entwicklung von mobilen Anwendungen","Entwicklung von Web-Anwendungen","Flutter für Entwickler"],"pt":["navegação no flutter","roteamento em flutter","links profundos em flutter","gerenciamento de fluxo de dados em flutter","integração com histórico do navegador em flutter","desenvolvimento de aplicações mobile e web em flutter"],"ru":["навигация во flutter","маршрутизация во flutter","глубокие ссылки во flutter","управление потоком данных во flutter","интеграция с историей браузера во flutter","разработка мобильных и веб-приложений во flutter для ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["التنقل في فلتر","التحويل في فلتر","الروابط العميقة في فلتر","إدارة تدفق البيانات في فلتر","التكامل مع تاريخ المتصفح في فلتر","تنمية التطبيقات الموبايل والويب في فلتر"]}},"owner":"abd0-omar","repo":"Flutter-POS","repoPath":"abd0-omar/Flutter-POS","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.397Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"flutter-navigation","description":"Comprehensive guide for Flutter navigation and routing including Navigator API, go_router, deep linking, passing/returning data, and web-specific navigation. Use when implementing screen transitions, configuring routing systems, setting up deep links, handling browser history, or managing navigation state in Flutter applications.","bodyPreview":"# Flutter Navigation\n\n## Overview\n\nImplement navigation and routing in Flutter applications across mobile and web platforms. Choose the right navigation approach, configure deep linking, manage data flow between screens, and handle browser history integration.\n\n## Choosing an Approach\n\n### Use Navigator API (Imperative) When:\n- Simple apps without deep linking requirements\n- Single-screen to multi-screen transitions\n- Basic navigation stacks\n- Quick prototyping\n\nExample: `assets/navigator_basic.","body":"# Flutter Navigation\n\n## Overview\n\nImplement navigation and routing in Flutter applications across mobile and web platforms. Choose the right navigation approach, configure deep linking, manage data flow between screens, and handle browser history integration.\n\n## Choosing an Approach\n\n### Use Navigator API (Imperative) When:\n- Simple apps without deep linking requirements\n- Single-screen to multi-screen transitions\n- Basic navigation stacks\n- Quick prototyping\n\nExample: `assets/navigator_basic.dart`\n\n### Use go_router (Declarative) When:\n- Apps requiring deep linking (iOS, Android, Web)\n- Web applications with browser history support\n- Complex navigation patterns with multiple Navigator widgets\n- URL-based navigation needed\n- Production applications with scalable architecture\n\nExample: `assets/go_router_basic.dart`\n\n### Avoid Named Routes\nFlutter team does NOT recommend named routes. They have limitations:\n- Cannot customize deep link behavior\n- No browser forward button support\n- Always pushes new routes regardless of current state\n\n## Common Tasks\n\n### Pass Data Between Screens\n\n**With Navigator:**\n```dart\nNavigator.push(\n  context,\n  MaterialPageRoute(builder: (context) => DetailScreen(item: myItem)),\n);\n```\n\n**With go_router:**\n```dart\ncontext.push(''/details?id=123'');\n// Extract: final id = state.uri.queryParameters[''id''];\n```\n\nExample: `assets/passing_data.dart`\n\n### Return Data From Screens\n\n```dart\nfinal result = await Navigator.push(\n  context,\n  MaterialPageRoute<String>(builder: (context) => SelectionScreen()),\n);\nif (!context.mounted) return;\n```\n\nExample: `assets/returning_data.dart`\n\n### Configure Deep Linking\n\n**Android:** Configure `AndroidManifest.xml` intent filters\n**iOS:** Configure `Info.plist` for Universal Links\n**Web:** Automatic with go_router, choose URL strategy\n\nFor detailed setup: `references/deep-linking.md`\n\n### Web URL Strategy\n\n**Hash (default):** `example.com/#/path` - no server config needed\n**Path:** `example.com/path` - cleaner URLs, requires server config\n\nFor server setup: `references/web-navigation.md`\n\n## Navigation Methods\n\n### go_router Navigation\n- `context.go(''/path'')` - replace current route\n- `context.push(''/path'')` - add to stack\n- `context.pop()` - go back\n\n### Navigator Navigation\n- `Navigator.push()` - add route to stack\n- `Navigator.pop()` - remove route from stack\n\n## Advanced Topics\n\n**Route Guards:** Implement authentication redirects\n**Nested Routes:** Create shell routes with shared UI\n**Error Handling:** Handle 404 and navigation errors\n**Multiple Navigators:** Manage independent navigation stacks\n\nFor advanced patterns: `references/go_router-guide.md`\n\n## Decision Guide\n\nUse [navigation-patterns.md](references/navigation-patterns.md) for:\n- Complete comparison of navigation approaches\n- Deep linking behavior by platform\n- Web-specific considerations\n- Common patterns and anti-patterns\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:06:26.336Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile and Web Agents needing advanced navigation and routing capabilities in Flutter applications.","zh":"非常适合需要在Flutter应用中实现高级导航和路由功能的移动和Web代理。","ja":"Flutterアプリケーションで高度なナビゲーションとルーティング機能を必要とするモバイルとWebエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Flutter 애플리케이션에서 고급 내비게이션 및 라우팅 기능을 필요한 모바일 및 웹 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Móviles y Web que necesitan capacidades de navegación y enrutamiento avanzadas en aplicaciones Flutter.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents mobiles et Web nécessitant des fonctionnalités de navigation et de routage avancées dans les applications Flutter.","de":"Perfekt für Mobile- und Web-Agents, die erweiterte Navigation- und Routing-Funktionen in Flutter-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Móveis e Web que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de navegação e roteamento em aplicações Flutter.","ru":"Идеально подходит для мобильных и веб-агентов, которым необходимы расширенные возможности навигации и маршрутизации в приложениях Flutter.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الهاتف المحمول والويب الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة في التنقل والتوجيه في تطبيقات Flutter."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement navigation and routing in Flutter applications across mobile and web platforms, handling browser history integration and deep linking using the Navigator API.","zh":"赋予代理在Flutter应用程序中跨移动和Web平台实现导航和路由，处理浏览器历史记录集成和使用Navigator API的深度链接。","ja":"エージェントがFlutterアプリケーションでモバイルとWebプラットフォームをまたいでナビゲーションとルーティングを実装できるようにし、Navigator APIを使用したブラウザ履歴の統合とディープリンクを処理します。","ko":"에이전트가 Flutter 애플리케이션에서 모바일 및 웹 플랫폼을 통해 내비게이션 및 라우팅을 구현할 수 있게 하며, Navigator API를 사용하여 브라우저 기록 통합 및 심층 링크를 처리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar la navegación y el enrutamiento en aplicaciones Flutter en plataformas móviles y web, manejando la integración de historial del navegador y enlaces profundos mediante la Navigator API.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre la navigation et le routage dans les applications Flutter sur les plateformes mobile et web, en gérant l''intégration de l''historique du navigateur et les liens profonds à l''aide de la Navigator API.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Navigation und Routing in Flutter-Anwendungen auf mobilen und Web-Plattformen zu implementieren, wobei die Integration der Browser-Historie und Deep-Links über die Navigator-API gehandhabt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar navegação e roteamento em aplicações Flutter em plataformas móveis e web, lidando com a integração do histórico do navegador e o link profundo usando a Navigator API.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовать навигацию и маршрутизацию в приложениях Flutter на мобильных и веб-платформах, обрабатывая интеграцию истории браузера и глубокие ссылки с использованием Navigator API.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من تنفيذ التنقل والتوجيه في تطبيقات Flutter عبر منصات الهاتف المحمول والويب، ومعالجة دمج سجل المتصفح والرابط العميق باستخدام Navigator API."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing deep linking for mobile apps","Configuring browser history integration for web apps","Managing data flow between screens in multi-screen transitions"],"zh":["为移动应用程序实现深度链接","为Web应用程序配置浏览器历史记录集成","在多屏幕过渡中管理屏幕之间的数据流"],"ja":["モバイルアプリケーションでのディープリンクの実装","Webアプリケーションでのブラウザ履歴の統合の構成","複数画面遷移での画面間のデータフローの管理"],"ko":["모바일 애플리케이션에서 심층 링크 구현","웹 애플리케이션에서 브라우저 기록 통합 구성","다중 화면 전환에서 화면 간 데이터 흐름 관리"],"es":["Implementar enlaces profundos para aplicaciones móviles","Configurar la integración de historial del navegador para aplicaciones web","Administrar el flujo de datos entre pantallas en transiciones de varias pantallas"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des liens profonds pour les applications mobiles","Configurer l''intégration de l''historique du navigateur pour les applications Web","Gérer le flux de données entre les écrans lors de transitions à plusieurs écrans"],"de":["Deep-Links für Mobile-Apps implementieren","Browser-Historie-Integration für Web-Apps konfigurieren","Datenfluss zwischen Bildschirmen bei Transitions mit mehreren Bildschirmen verwalten"],"pt":["Implementação de link profundo para aplicativos móveis","Configuração da integração do histórico do navegador para aplicativos web","Gerenciamento do fluxo de dados entre telas em transições de tela múltipla"],"ru":["Реализация глубоких ссылок для мобильных приложений","Настройка интеграции истории браузера для веб-приложений","Управление потоком данных между экранами при многоэкранных переходах"],"ar":["تنفيذ الرابط العميق لتطبيقات الهاتف المحمول","تكوين دمج سجل المتصفح لتطبيقات الويب","إدارة تدفق البيانات بين الشاشات في انتقالات الشاشة المتعددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Flutter framework","Limited to mobile and web platforms"],"zh":["需要Flutter框架","仅限于移动和Web平台"],"ja":["Flutterフレームワークが必要","モバイルとWebプラットフォームに限定"],"ko":["Flutter 프레임워크 필요","모바일 및 웹 플랫폼에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere el framework Flutter","Limitado a plataformas móviles y web"],"fr":["Nécessite le framework Flutter","Limité aux plateformes mobile et web"],"de":["Benötigt das Flutter-Framework","Begrenzt auf mobile und Web-Plattformen"],"pt":["Exige o framework Flutter","Limitado a plataformas móveis e web"],"ru":["Требует фреймворка Flutter","Ограничен мобильными и веб-платформами"],"ar":["يتطلب إطار Flutter","محدود بالمنصات المتنقلة والويب"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"941c31f3f759b2b5fde7d8b9ca6a86934eb728f449c6a872dce71f78c5030611","qualityScore":33}');
