INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('kevincrabbe/wrapkit/general', 'general', 'kevincrabbe', 'wrapkit', 'community', 'general kevincrabbe wrapkit community The general skill provides guidelines for coding best practices, focusing on readability and performance. It benefits developers by ensuring correctness, maintainability, and efficiency in their code. 本指南提供了优化代码的可读性和性能的最佳实践，适用于所有开发项目 このガイドでは、すべての開発プロジェクトに適用できるコードの可読性とパフォーマンスの最適化方法を提供します 이 가이드는 모든 개발 프로젝트에 적용할 수 있는 코드의 가독성과 성능을 최적화하는 방법을 제공합니다 El desarrollo general de agentes de IA requiere prioridades claras y comentarios efectivos. Aprende a equilibrar la legibilidad y el rendimiento Le développement général des outils d''IA nécessite des priorités claires et des commentaires efficaces. Apprenez à équilibrer la lisibilité et les performances Die allgemeine Entwicklung von KI-Agenten erfordert klare Prioritäten und effektive Kommentare. Lernen Sie, Lesbarkeit und Leistung auszugleichen Desenvolvimento geral para ferramentas de IA com foco em legibilidade e desempenho Общая разработка для ИИ Агентов с фокусом на читаемости и производительности التطوير العام لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي مع التركيز على سهولة القراءة والأداء how to use general coding guidelines general coding best practices general vs clean code general install guide general setup for developers what is general coding general alternative coding guidelines general coding performance optimization general readability guidelines general coding efficiency tips 通用开发指南 代码优化 可读性 性能 AIエージェント开发 代码注释 代码维护 Prioritizes code readability and performance with a 80/20 focus Enforces commenting guidelines to explain code purpose Supports maintainability by emphasizing correctness and functionality Promotes efficient coding practices through performance optimization Provides guidelines for commenting obvious operations Encourages developers to focus on code explainability General is a set of coding guidelines that prioritize readability and performance, emphasizing correctness, maintainability, and efficiency in software development.');
