estilizadas con React","fr":"Guide de mise en place d''envoltures stylisées avec React","de":"Einrichten von gestylten Wrappern mit React","pt":"Criando Wrappers Estilizados: Guia de Configuração para R...","ru":"Создание Стилизованных Оболочек: Руководство по Настройке...","ar":"إنشاء حاويات مصممة: دليل الإعداد للتعلم الاصطناعي و React"},"description":{"en":"Discover how to create styled wrapper components with creating-styled-wrappers. Learn to compose headless base compound components with ease and transform yo...","zh":"使用Agentic Generative UI Platform创建样式包装器，实现React应用的快速开发","ja":"AIエージェントを使用してスタイル付きラッパーを作成し、Reactアプリの開発を迅速化","ko":"Agentic Generative UI Platform을 사용하여 스타일된 래퍼를 생성하고 React 애플리케이션 개발을 가속화","es":"Aprende a crear envolturas estilizadas para componentes de React con la plataforma Agentic Generative UI","fr":"Découvrez comment créer des envoltures stylisées pour les composants React avec la plateforme Agentic Generative UI","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie gestylte Wraper für React-Komponenten mit der Agentic Generative UI-Plattform erstellen","pt":"Aprenda a criar wrappers estilizados para componentes React com o Agentic Generative UI Platform e melhore a experiência do usuário","ru":"Узнайте, как создать стилизованные оболочки для компонентов React с помощью Agentic Generative UI Platform и ИИ Агентов","ar":"تعلم كيفية إنشاء حاويات مصممة لمكونات React مع منصة Agentic Generative UI ووكلاء التعلم الاصطناعي"},"definition":{"en":"creating-styled-wrappers is a skill that enables the creation of styled wrapper components for React apps, utilizing autonomous Tambo agents and Model Context Protocol (MCP)","zh":"创建样式包装器是指使用Agentic Generative UI Platform创建样式化的React组件","ja":"スタイル付きラッパーの作成とは、AIエージェントを使用してスタイル化されたReactコンポーネントを作成すること","ko":"스타일된 래퍼 생성은 Agentic Generative UI Platform을 사용하여 스타일된 React 컴포넌트를 생성하는 것을 의미","es":"La creación de envolturas estilizadas es una técnica para combinar componentes de React con estilos y comportamientos personalizados","fr":"La création d''envoltures stylisées est une technique pour combiner des composants React avec des styles et des comportements personnalisés","de":"Die Erstellung von gestylten Wrappern ist eine Technik zur Kombination von React-Komponenten mit benutzerdefinierten Stilen und Verhaltensweisen","pt":"Criar wrappers estilizados é a capacidade de compor componentes React com estilos e comportamentos adicionais","ru":"Создание стилизованных оболочек - это способность композировать компоненты React с стилями и дополнительным поведением","ar":"إنشاء حاويات مصممة هو القدرة على تركيب مكونات React مع أنماط و سلوكيات إضافية"},"features":{"en":["Creates styled wrapper components that compose headless base compound components","Utilizes autonomous Tambo agents for efficient component creation","Leverages Model Context Protocol (MCP) for codebase grounding","Supports secure E2B sandboxed execution for reliable deployment","Complements the building-compound-components skill for comprehensive React app development","Provides a real-world example for refactoring MessageInput components"],"zh":["使用Model Context Protocol (MCP)实现代码库接地","支持安全的E2B沙箱执行","组合头部组件实现快速开发","使用React创建生产就绪的应用","支持自主Tambo代理"],"ja":["Model Context Protocol (MCP)を使用してコードベースを接地","セキュアなE2Bサンドボックス実行をサポート","ヘッドレスコンポーネントを組み合わせて迅速に開発","Reactを使用してプロダクション就緒のアプリを作成","自主Tamboエージェントをサポート"],"ko":["Model Context Protocol (MCP)을 사용하여 코드베이스를 접지","보안 E2B 샌드박스 실행을 지원","헤드리스 컴포넌트를 구성하여 빠른 개발","React를 사용하여 프로덕션 준비된 애플리케이션을 생성","자립형 Tambo 에이전트를 지원"],"es":["Creación de envolturas estilizadas para componentes de React","Uso de la plataforma Agentic Generative UI para generar aplicaciones React","Integración con protocolo de contexto de modelo (MCP) para anclaje de código","Ejecución segura en sandbox E2B","Combinación de componentes de React con estilos y comportamientos personalizados"],"fr":["Création d''envoltures stylisées pour les composants React","Utilisation de la plateforme Agentic Generative UI pour générer des applications React","Intégration avec le protocole de contexte de modèle (MCP) pour l''ancre de code","Exécution sécurisée dans un sandbox E2B","Combinaison de composants React avec des styles et des comportements personnalisés"],"de":["Erstellung von gestylten Wrappern für React-Komponenten","Verwendung der Agentic Generative UI-Plattform zur Generierung von React-Anwendungen","Integration mit dem Modellkontextprotokoll (MCP) zur Codeverankerung","Sichere Ausführung in einem E2B-Sandbox","Kombination von React-Komponenten mit benutzerdefinierten Stilen und Verhaltensweisen"],"pt":["Composição de componentes React com estilos e comportamentos adicionais","Uso do Agentic Generative UI Platform para criar wrappers estilizados","Integração com o protocolo de contexto de modelo (MCP) para ancoragem de código","Execução segura em sandbox E2B","Compatibilidade com componentes headless base"],"ru":["Композиция компонентов React с стилями и дополнительным поведением","Использование платформы Agentic Generative UI для создания стилизованных оболочек","Интеграция с протоколом контекста модели (MCP) для якорения кода","Безопасная работа в песочнице E2B","Совместимость с базовыми компонентами без головы"],"ar":["تركيب مكونات React مع أنماط و سلوكيات إضافية","استخدام منصة Agentic Generative UI لإنشاء حاويات مصممة","التكامل مع بروتوكول السياق النمطي (MCP) لتثبيت الكود","التنفيذ الآمن في حاوية الرمل E2B","التوافق مع المكونات الأساسية بدون رأس"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use creating-styled-wrappers","creating-styled-wrappers react","styled wrapper components","creating-styled-wrappers alternative","creating-styled-wrappers setup guide","creating-styled-wrappers vs building-compound-components","creating-styled-wrappers install","react app development with creating-styled-wrappers","creating-styled-wrappers tutorial","creating-styled-wrappers documentation"],"zh":["创建样式包装器","Agentic Generative UI Platform","React应用开发","Model Context Protocol","E2B沙箱执行","自主Tambo代理","AIエージェント","React组件"],"ja":["スタイル付きラッパー作成","AIエージェント","Reactアプリ開発","Model Context Protocol","E2Bサンドボックス実行","自主Tamboエージェント","Reactコンポーネント","Agentic Generative UI Platform"],"ko":["스타일된 래퍼 생성","Agentic Generative UI Platform","React 애플리케이션 개발","Model Context Protocol","E2B 샌드박스 실행","자립형 Tambo 에이전트","AI 에이전트","React 컴포넌트"],"es":["creación de envolturas estilizadas","react","agentic generative ui","protocolo de contexto de modelo","sandbox e2b","desarrollo de aplicaciones react","estilos personalizados para react","comportamientos personalizados para react","herramientas de ai para react"],"fr":["création d''envoltures stylisées","react","agentic generative ui","protocole de contexte de modèle","sandbox e2b","développement d''applications react","styles personnalisés pour react","comportements personnalisés pour react","outils d''ia pour react"],"de":["erstellung von gestylten wrappern","react","agentic generative ui","modellkontextprotokoll","e2b-sandbox","entwicklung von react-anwendungen","benutzerdefinierte styles für react","benutzerdefinierte verhaltensweisen für react","ai-tools für react"],"pt":["wrappers estilizados","componentes React","Agentic Generative UI Platform","protocolo de contexto de modelo","execução segura em sandbox","desenvolvimento de interfaces de usuário","criação de wrappers estilizados","componentes headless","estilos e comportamentos adicionais"],"ru":["стилизованные оболочки","компоненты React","платформа Agentic Generative UI","протокол контекста модели","безопасная работа в песочнице","разработка интерфейсов пользователя","создание стилизованных оболочек","компоненты без головы","стили и дополнительное поведение"],"ar":["حاويات مصممة","مكونات React","منصة Agentic Generative UI","بروتوكول السياق النمطي","التنفيذ الآمن في حاوية الرمل","تطوير واجهات المستخدم","إنشاء حاويات مصممة","مكونات بدون رأس","أنماط و سلوكيات إضافية"]}},"owner":"Sri-Krishna-V","repo":"Derived-WMD","repoPath":"Sri-Krishna-V/Derived-WMD","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.416Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"creating-styled-wrappers","description":"Creates styled wrapper components that compose headless/base compound components. Use when refactoring styled components to use base primitives, implementing opinionated design systems on top of headless components, or when the user mentions use base components, compose primitives, styled wrapper, or refactor to use base.","bodyPreview":"# Styling Compound Wrappers\n\nCreate styled wrapper components that compose headless base compound components. This skill complements `building-compound-components` (which builds the base primitives) by focusing on **how to properly consume and wrap them** with styling and additional behavior.\n\n**Real-world example**: See [references/real-world-example.md](references/real-world-example.md) for a complete before/after MessageInput refactoring.\n\n## Core Principle: Compose, Don''t Duplicate\n\nStyled w","body":"# Styling Compound Wrappers\n\nCreate styled wrapper components that compose headless base compound components. This skill complements `building-compound-components` (which builds the base primitives) by focusing on **how to properly consume and wrap them** with styling and additional behavior.\n\n**Real-world example**: See [references/real-world-example.md](references/real-world-example.md) for a complete before/after MessageInput refactoring.\n\n## Core Principle: Compose, Don''t Duplicate\n\nStyled wrappers should **compose** base components, not **re-implement** their logic.\n\n```tsx\n// WRONG - re-implementing what base already does\nconst StyledInput = ({ children, className }) => {\n  const { value, setValue, submit } = useTamboThreadInput(); // Duplicated!\n  const [isDragging, setIsDragging] = useState(false); // Duplicated!\n  const handleDrop = useCallback(/* ... */); // Duplicated!\n\n  return (\n    <form onDrop={handleDrop} className={className}>\n      {children}\n    </form>\n  );\n};\n\n// CORRECT - compose the base component\nconst StyledInput = ({ children, className, variant }) => {\n  return (\n    <BaseInput.Root className={cn(inputVariants({ variant }), className)}>\n      <BaseInput.Content className=\"rounded-xl data-[dragging]:border-dashed\">\n        {children}\n      </BaseInput.Content>\n    </BaseInput.Root>\n  );\n};\n```\n\n## Refactoring Workflow\n\nCopy this checklist and track progress:\n\n```\nStyled Wrapper Refactoring:\n- [ ] Step 1: Identify duplicated logic\n- [ ] Step 2: Import base components\n- [ ] Step 3: Wrap with Base Root\n- [ ] Step 4: Apply state-based styling and behavior\n- [ ] Step 5: Wrap sub-components with styling\n- [ ] Step 6: Final verification\n```\n\n### Step 1: Identify Duplicated Logic\n\nLook for patterns that indicate logic should come from base:\n\n- SDK hooks (`useTamboThread`, `useTamboThreadInput`, etc.)\n- Context creation (`React.createContext`)\n- State management that mirrors base component state\n- Event handlers (drag, submit, etc.) that base components handle\n\n### Step 2: Import Base Components\n\n```tsx\nimport { MessageInput as MessageInputBase } from \"@tambo-ai/react-ui-base/message-input\";\n```\n\n### Step 3: Wrap with Base Root\n\nReplace custom context/state management with the base Root:\n\n```tsx\n// Before\nconst MessageInput = ({ children, variant }) => {\n  return (\n    <MessageInputInternal variant={variant}>{children}</MessageInputInternal>\n  );\n};\n\n// After\nconst MessageInput = ({ children, variant, className }) => {\n  return (\n    <MessageInputBase.Root className={cn(variants({ variant }), className)}>\n      {children}\n    </MessageInputBase.Root>\n  );\n};\n```\n\n### Step 4: Apply State-Based Styling and Behavior\n\nState access follows a hierarchy — use the simplest option that works:\n\n1. **Data attributes** (preferred for styling) — base components expose `data-*` attributes\n2. **Render props** (for behavior changes) — use when rendering different components\n3. **Context hooks** (for sub-components) — OK for styled sub-components needing deep context access\n\n```tsx\n// BEST - data-* classes for styling, render props only for behavior\n// Note: use `data-[dragging]:*` syntax (v3-compatible), not `data-dragging:*` (v4 only)\nconst StyledContent = ({ children }) => (\n  <BaseComponent.Content\n    className={cn(\n      \"group rounded-xl border\",\n      \"data-[dragging]:border-dashed data-[dragging]:border-emerald-400\",\n    )}\n  >\n    {({ elicitation, resolveElicitation }) => (\n      <>\n        {/* Drop overlay uses group-data-* for styling */}\n        <div className=\"hidden group-data-[dragging]:flex absolute inset-0 bg-emerald-50/90\">\n          <p>Drop files here</p>\n        </div>\n\n        {elicitation ? (\n          <ElicitationUI\n            request={elicitation}\n            onResponse={resolveElicitation}\n          />\n        ) : (\n          children\n        )}\n      </>\n    )}\n  </BaseComponent.Content>\n);\n\n// OK - styled sub-components can use context hook for deep access\nconst StyledTextarea = ({ placeholder }) => {\n  const { value, setValue, handleSubmit, editorRef } = useMessageInputContext();\n  return (\n    <CustomEditor\n      ref={editorRef}\n      value={value}\n      onChange={setValue}\n      onSubmit={handleSubmit}\n      placeholder={placeholder}\n    />\n  );\n};\n```\n\n**When to use context hooks vs render props:**\n\n- Render props: when the parent wrapper needs state for behavior changes\n- Context hooks: when a styled sub-component needs values not exposed via render props\n\n### Step 5: Wrap Sub-Components\n\n```tsx\n// Submit button\nconst SubmitButton = ({ className, children }) => (\n  <BaseComponent.SubmitButton className={cn(\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg\", className)}>\n    {({ showCancelButton }) =>\n      children ?? (showCancelButton ? <Square /> : <ArrowUp />)\n    }\n  </BaseComponent.SubmitButton>\n);\n\n// Error\nconst Error = ({ className }) => (\n  <BaseComponent.Error className={cn(\"text-sm text-destructive\", className)} />\n);\n\n// Staged images - base pre-computes props array, just iterate\nconst StagedImages = ({ className }) => (\n  <BaseComponent.StagedImages className={cn(\"flex gap-2\", className)}>\n    {({ images }) =>\n      images.map((imageProps) => (\n        <ImageBadge key={imageProps.image.id} {...imageProps} />\n      ))\n    }\n  </BaseComponent.StagedImages>\n);\n```\n\n### Step 6: Final Verification\n\n```\nFinal Checks:\n- [ ] No duplicate context creation\n- [ ] No duplicate SDK hooks in root wrappers\n- [ ] No duplicate state management or event handlers\n- [ ] Base namespace imported and `Base.Root` used as wrapper\n- [ ] `data-*` classes used for styling (with `group-data-*` for children)\n- [ ] Render props used only for rendering behavior changes\n- [ ] Base sub-components wrapped with styling\n- [ ] Icon factories passed from styled layer to base hooks\n- [ ] Visual sub-components and CSS variants stay in styled layer\n```\n\n## What Belongs in Styled Layer\n\n### Icon Factories\n\nWhen base hooks need icons, pass a factory function:\n\n```tsx\n// Base hook accepts optional icon factory\nexport function useCombinedResourceList(\n  providers: ResourceProvider[] | undefined,\n  search: string,\n  createMcpIcon?: (serverName: string) => React.ReactNode,\n) {\n  /* ... */\n}\n\n// Styled layer provides the factory\nconst resources = useCombinedResourceList(providers, search, (serverName) => (\n  <McpServerIcon name={serverName} className=\"w-4 h-4\" />\n));\n```\n\n### CSS Variants\n\n```tsx\nconst inputVariants = cva(\"w-full\", {\n  variants: {\n    variant: {\n      default: \"\",\n      solid: \"[&>div]:shadow-xl [&>div]:ring-1\",\n      bordered: \"[&>div]:border-2\",\n    },\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Layout Logic, Visual Sub-Components, Custom Data Fetching\n\nThese all stay in the styled layer. Base handles behavior; styled handles presentation.\n\n## Type Handling\n\nHandle ref type differences between base and styled components:\n\n```tsx\n// Base context may have RefObject<T | null>\n// Styled component may need RefObject<T>\n<TextEditor ref={editorRef as React.RefObject<TamboEditor>} />\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- **Re-implementing base logic** - if base handles it, compose it\n- **Using render props for styling** - prefer `data-*` classes; render props are for behavior changes\n- **Duplicating context in wrapper** - use base Root which provides context\n- **Hardcoding icons in base hooks** - use factory functions to keep styling in styled layer\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:07:16.155Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced UI component styling and composition capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 UI 组件样式和组合能力的前端代理。","ja":"フロントエンド エージェントが高度な UI コンポーネントのスタイリングと組み合わせ機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 UI 컴포넌트 스타일링 및組み合わせ 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de estilismo y composición de componentes de interfaz de usuario.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui nécessitent des capacités avancées de personnalisation et de composition de composants d''interface utilisateur.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte UI-Komponenten-Styling- und Zusammensetzungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de estilização e composição de componentes de UI.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности стилизации и составления компонентов UI.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى قابليات متقدمة لتنسيق وتركيب مكونات الواجهة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create reusable, styled wrapper components that complement base primitives, utilizing core principles like ''Compose, Don''t Duplicate'' for efficient UI development, and leveraging styling and behavior for enhanced user experience.","zh":"赋予代理创建可重用、样式化的包装组件的能力，这些组件可以补充基本原语，利用 ''组合，不要复制'' 等核心原则进行高效的 UI 开发，并利用样式和行为来增强用户体验。","ja":"エージェントが再利用可能なスタイル化されたラッパーコンポーネントを作成できるようにし、基本的なプリミティブを補完し、''コンポーズ、複製しない'' などのコア原則を使用して効率的な UI 開発を行い、スタイリングと動作を利用してユーザー体験を強化します。","ko":"에이전트가 재사용 가능한 스타일화된 래퍼 컴포넌트를 생성할 수 있도록 하여 기본 원시 값을 보완하고 ''구성, 복제하지 않음''과 같은 핵심 원칙을 사용하여 효율적인 UI 개발을 수행하며 스타일링과 동작을 활용하여 사용자 경험을 향상합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear componentes de wrapper reutilizables y personalizados que complementan los primitivos base, utilizando principios básicos como ''Componer, no duplicar'' para un desarrollo de interfaz de usuario eficiente, y aprovechando el estilismo y el comportamiento para una experiencia del usuario mejorada.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des composants de wrapper réutilisables et personnalisés qui complètent les primitives de base, en utilisant des principes de base tels que ''Composer, ne pas dupliquer'' pour un développement d''interface utilisateur efficace, et en exploitant la personnalisation et le comportement pour une expérience utilisateur améliorée.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, wiederverwendbare, gestylte Wrapper-Komponenten zu erstellen, die die Basisprimitiven ergänzen, indem sie grundlegende Prinzipien wie ''Komponieren, nicht duplizieren'' für eine effiziente UI-Entwicklung nutzen und das Styling und Verhalten für eine verbesserte Benutzererfahrung ausnutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar componentes de wrapper reutilizáveis e estilizados que complementam os primitivos base, utilizando princípios básicos como ''Compor, Não Duplicar'' para desenvolvimento de UI eficiente, e aproveitando a estilização e o comportamento para uma experiência do usuário aprimorada.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать многократно используемые, стилизованные компоненты-оболочки, которые дополняют базовые примитивы, используя основные принципы, такие как ''Составлять, Не Дублировать'' для эффективного развития UI, и используя стилизацию и поведение для улучшения пользовательского опыта.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء مكونات غلاف قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام ومصممة بطريقة تعزز المكونات الأساسية باستخدام مبادئ أساسية مثل ''تكوين بدلاً من تكرار'' لتطوير واجهة المستخدم بكفاءة، وتحسين تجربة المستخدم من خلال التنسيق والسلوك"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating the creation of consistent UI themes across applications","Generating reusable, styled wrappers for headless base compound components","Debugging and refining styling issues in complex UI component hierarchies"],"zh":["跨应用程序自动创建一致的 UI 主题","为无头基础复合组件生成可重用、样式化的包装器","在复杂的 UI 组件层次结构中调试和完善样式问题"],"ja":["アプリケーション全体で一貫した UI テーマの自動作成","ヘッドレス ベース コンポウンド コンポーネント用の再利用可能なスタイル化されたラッパーを生成","複雑な UI コンポーネント階層構造内でのスタイリングの問題のデバッグと改善"],"ko":["애플리케이션 전체에서 일관된 UI 테마를 자동으로 생성","헤드리스 기본 복합 컴포넌트를 위한 재사용 가능한 스타일화된 래퍼를 생성","복잡한 UI 컴포넌트 계층 구조 내에서 스타일링 문제를 디버깅하고 개선"],"es":["Automatizar la creación de temas de interfaz de usuario coherentes en aplicaciones","Generar wrappers reutilizables y personalizados para componentes base compuestos sin cabeza","Depurar y perfeccionar problemas de estilismo en jerarquías de componentes de interfaz de usuario complejas"],"fr":["Automatiser la création de thèmes d''interface utilisateur cohérents dans les applications","Générer des wrappers réutilisables et personnalisés pour les composants de base compuestos sans tête","Déboguer et affiner les problèmes de personnalisation dans les hiérarchies de composants d''interface utilisateur complexes"],"de":["Automatisieren der Erstellung konsistenter UI-Themen in Anwendungen","Erzeugen wiederverwendbarer, gestylter Wrapper für headless Basis-Verbundkomponenten","Debuggen und Verfeinern von Styling-Problemen in komplexen UI-Komponenten-Hierarchien"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de temas de UI consistentes em aplicativos","Gerar invólucros reutilizáveis e estilizados para componentes base compostos headless","Depurar e refinar problemas de estilização em hierarquias complexas de componentes de UI"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание последовательных тем UI в приложениях","Генерировать многократно используемые, стилизованные оболочки для базовых составных компонентов headless","Отлаживать и дорабатывать проблемы стилизации в сложных иерархиях компонентов UI"],"ar":["توفير آلي لإنشاء سمات الواجهة الموحدة عبر التطبيقات","توليد غلاف قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام ومصممة لعناصر مكونة أساسية بدون رأس","تصحيح الأخطاء وتحسين مشاكل التنسيق في التسلسلات الهرمية المعقدة لمكونات الواجهة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of base primitives and compound components","Limited to UI component styling and composition"],"zh":["需要了解基本原语和复合组件","仅限 UI 组件样式和组合"],"ja":["基本的なプリミティブとコンポウンド コンポーネントの知識が必要","UI コンポーネントのスタイリングと組み合わせに限定"],"ko":["기본 원시 값과 복합 컴포넌트에 대한 지식이 필요","UI 컴포넌트 스타일링 및 조합에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de primitivos base y componentes compuestos","Limitado a la personalización y composición de componentes de interfaz de usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances sur les primitives de base et les composants composés","Limité à la personnalisation et à la composition de composants d''interface utilisateur"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse über Basisprimitiven und Verbundkomponenten","Begrenzt auf die Gestaltung und Zusammensetzung von UI-Komponenten"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento dos primitivos base e componentes compostos","Limitado à estilização e composição de componentes de UI"],"ru":["Требует знания базовых примитивов и составных компонентов","Ограничен стилизацией и составлением компонентов UI"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة البدائيات الأساسية والمكونات المركبة","محدود بالتنسيق وتركيب مكونات الواجهة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"8eb4257714e267203adf3de0f94b836fcd492c3d4a1f9779e75943e9d5c88b7f","qualityScore":33}');
